man-elon-musk-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESam%20Altman%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20who%20has%20made%20similar%20calls%20in%20the%20past%2C%20agreed%20in%20an%20X%20post%20later%20that%20day.%20So%20did%20Elon%20Musk.%20Google%20DeepMind%20founder%20Demis%20Hassabis%20also%20offered%20his%20support%20for%20Amodei's%20proposals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20a%20look%20at%20what%20smart%20people%20are%20saying%20about%20the%20AI%20apocalypse%20and%20the%20methods%20the%20leaders%20of%20the%20leading%20AI%20labs%20say%20are%20necessary%20to%20stop%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EDavid%20Sacks%2C%20a%20presidential%20advisor%20on%20science%20and%20tech%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22David%20Sacks%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F69d9509396ef6a4c9d121c99%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDavid%20Sacks%2C%20former%20White%20House%20AI%20czar%2C%20expressed%20some%20skepticism%20over%20Anthropic's%20mythos%20warnings.%3Cp%3EMatt%20McClain%2FThe%20Washington%20Post%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trump%20administration%20has%20repeatedly%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-kill-switch-bill-openai-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esignaled%20disinterest%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20regulating%20AI%20development%20as%20it%20seeks%20to%20keep%20pace%20with%20China.%20David%20Sacks%2C%20a%20presidential%20advisor%20on%20science%20and%20tech%20and%20the%20former%20White%20House%20AI%20Czar%2C%20reiterated%20that%20stance%20on%20Saturday%2C%20with%20a%20bit%20of%20a%20twist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BDario%20has%20written%20that%20we%20need%20to%20'pace%20the%20frontier%2C'%20and%20Sam%20has%20agreed.%20People%20may%20be%20surprised%20by%20my%20response%3A%20go%20ahead%2C%26quot%3B%20Sacks%20wrote%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BBut%20stop%20pretending%20you%20need%20anyone%20else's%20permission.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESacks%20browbeat%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20in%20his%20post%2C%20saying%20that%20the%20companies%20didn't%20want%20to%20slow%20down%20for%20altruistic%20reasons%2C%20but%20to%20gain%20favor%20in%20the%20markets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20you%20do%2C%20you'll%20buy%20goodwill%20for%20the%20next%20conversation%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20of%20a%20slowdown.%20%26quot%3BIf%20you%20don't%2C%20we'll%20know%20this%20was%20just%20another%20bid%20for%20regulatory%20capture%20%E2%80%94%20or%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-everyone-hates-data-center-ai-industry-debate-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eelection-season%20psyop%3C%2Fa%3E.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ECl%C3%A9ment%20Delangue%2C%20Hugging%20Face%20CEO%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22clement%20delangue%2C%20ceo%20of%20hugging%20face%2C%20sits%20in%20front%20of%20a%20camera%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a60930254f987526177814a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222662%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20CEO%20of%20Hugging%20Face%2C%20which%20was%20itself%20the%20victim%20of%20a%20notorious%20attack%20in%20July%20by%20OpenAI%20agents%20who%20schemed%2C%20communicated%2C%20and%20lied%20to%20evade%20detection%2C%20said%20AI%20safety%20can't%20be%20left%20solely%20to%20frontier%20labs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHugging%20Face%2C%20as%20an%20open-source-focused%20AI%20company%2C%20has%20long%20pushed%20for%20models%20and%20research%20to%20be%20shared%20more%20openly%20rather%20than%20kept%20behind%20closed%20doors.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%20said%20his%20company%20was%20launching%20what%20he%20called%20the%20%26quot%3Bopen%20alignment%20initiative%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20asked%20that%20it%20be%20included%20in%20Amodei's%20proposed%20third-party%20evaluator%20program.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BLet's%20make%20AI%20safer%20by%20making%20it%20more%20transparent!%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJason%20Calacanis%2C%20investor%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Jason%20Calacanis%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6ae07054f987526177b88c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJason%20Calacanis%20said%20that%20the%20ban%20was%20%26quot%3Bsmart%26quot%3B%20because%20of%20the%20risk%20of%20terrorism.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EInvestor%2C%20host%20of%20the%20%26quot%3BAll-In%26quot%3B%20podcast%2C%20and%20industry%20expert%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarlink-more-important-than-price-route-or-time-jason-calacanis-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJason%20Calacanis%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20a%20lot%20more%20dubious%20than%20others%20that%20AI%20could%20actually%20cause%20the%20end%20of%20the%20world.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20an%20X%20post%2C%20Calacanis%20said%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20whose%20most%20advanced%20models%20are%20not%20open-sourced%2C%20are%20attempting%20to%20kneecap%20open-source%20AI%20companies%20by%20pushing%20for%20regulations%20that%20would%20be%20far%20easier%20for%20deep-pocketed%20incumbents%20to%20comply%20with.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20you%20want%20safety%2C%20you%20want%20disclosure%20%E2%80%94%20and%20open%20source%20is%20the%20ultimate%20disclosure%20process%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20follow-up%20post%20tagging%20Amodei%2C%20Calacanis%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BDon't%20go%20crying%20to%20the%20government%20and%20beg%20them%20to%20slow%20down%20open%20source%20models.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EBernie%20Sanders%2C%20Vermont%20senator%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222754%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Vermont%20Senator%20Bernie%20Sanders.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa6dffaec15fe2d3cf16ccf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221854%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EVermont%20Senator%20Bernie%20Sanders.%3Cp%3EKen%20Cedeno%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbernie-sanders-letter-ai-ceos-amodei-altman-zuckerberg-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esenator%20from%20Vermont%3C%2Fa%3E%20proposed%20legislation%20on%20September%203%20that%20would%20ban%20the%20development%20and%20deployment%20of%20artificial%20superintelligence%20and%20temporarily%20pause%20the%20development%20of%20advanced%20AI%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20Coxon%20resigned%20from%20Anthropic%20and%20warned%20that%20frontier%20AI%20labs%20were%20%26quot%3Bgambling%20with%20our%20lives%2C%26quot%3B%20Sanders%20seized%20on%20his%20comments.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMr.%20Coxon%20is%20right%2C%26quot%3B%20Sanders%20said%20on%20X%2C%20arguing%20that%20the%20people%20building%20advanced%20AI%20themselves%20have%20said%20it%20could%20pose%20catastrophic%20risks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20Amodei's%20blog%20post%20on%20Saturday%2C%20Sanders%20called%20on%20Trump%20to%20make%20the%20%26quot%3Bdeal%20of%20the%20century.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWith%20the%20future%20of%20humanity%20at%20stake%2C%20Trump%20must%20negotiate%20a%20comprehensive%20treaty%20with%20President%20Xi%20of%20China%20to%20establish%20a%20pause%20on%20advanced%20AI%20development%20and%20a%20ban%20on%20super%20intelligence%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EFrancois%20Chollet%2C%20AI%20researcher%3Cp%3EFrancois%20Chollet%2C%20an%20AI%20researcher%20who%20created%20Keras%2C%20an%20open-source%20software%20library%2C%20said%20on%20X%20that%20he%20hoped%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20were%20operating%20in%20good%20faith.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20these%20efforts%20are%20genuine%2C%20then%20oversight%20must%20take%20a%20more%20democratic%20and%20accountable%20form%2C%20with%20both%20national%20and%20international%20components%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20pointed%20to%20several%20signs%20he%20said%20would%20indicate%20that%20calls%20for%20more%20regulation%20are%20actually%20tricks%20for%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20to%20stifle%20competition.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20warning%20signs%20he%20mentioned%20include%20calls%20to%20ban%20open-sourced%20AI%20and%20to%20hinder%20non-frontier%20research.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EGavin%20Baker%2C%20venture%20capitalist%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225435%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Gavin%20Baker%2C%20managing%20partner%20of%20Atreides%20Management%2C%20is%20pictured.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a96dcbd45e6f385a516b6c1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223625%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EVenture%20capitalist%20Gavin%20Baker%20said%20an%20executive%20order%20from%20President%20Donald%20Trump%20%26quot%3Bseems%20likely%20after%20all%20this.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20is%20possible%20to%20democratize%20and%20distribute%20AI%20broadly%20and%20safely%20without%20centralizing%20it%20in%20the%20hands%20of%20a%20few%20corporations%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBaker%20said%20the%20most%20concrete%20development%20so%20far%20is%20the%20decision%20by%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20to%20bring%20in%20outside%20evaluators%2C%20a%20move%20he%20said%20could%20help%20the%20companies%20show%20they%20took%20reasonable%20steps%20to%20prevent%20harm.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20he%20cautioned%20against%20regulations%20that%20would%20concentrate%20control%20of%20powerful%20AI%20systems%20among%20a%20handful%20of%20companies.%20%26quot%3BI%20do%20not%20want%20a%20few%20humans%20in%20control%20of%20intelligence%2C%26quot%3B%20Baker%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAaron%20Levie%2C%20CEO%20of%20Box%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224176%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22aaron%20levie%20sits%20on%20stage%20speaking%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5a2723548c9c486b30d336%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222784%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EKimberly%20White%2FGetty%20Images%20for%20TechCrunch%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAaron%20Levie%2C%20the%20cofounder%20and%20CEO%20of%20Box%2C%20a%20cloud%20content%20company%2C%20said%20Amodei's%20goals%2C%20as%20laid%20out%20in%20his%20essay%2C%20are%20%26quot%3Babsolute%20necessities%20in%20AI%20development.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20completely%20stands%20to%20reason%20that%20we%20want%20these%20systems%20to%20be%20safe%20and%20'aligned%2C'%26quot%3B%20Levie%20said%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELevie%20said%20he%20didn't%20think%20Amodei%20is%20seeking%20undue%20regulation%20that%20would%20hobble%20Anthropic's%20open-source%20competitors.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHow%20we%20get%20there%20%E2%80%94%20without%20meaningfully%20slowing%20down%20innovation%20progress%20or%20reducing%20competition%20%E2%80%94%20is%20one%20of%20the%20most%20complex%20questions%20in%20the%2021st%20century%2C%20but%20the%20need%20is%20clearly%20real%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EChamath%20Palihapitiya%2C%20venture%20capitalist%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223883%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Chamath%20Palihapitiya.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5703dfeae3978eb7e5e07b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222589%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EChamath%20Palihapitiya.%3Cp%3EJC%20Olivera%2FVariety%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EVenture%20capitalist%20Chamath%20Palihapitiya%20said%20Anthropic%20is%20now%20caught%20in%20a%20contradiction%20of%20its%20own%20making.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20employees%20genuinely%20believe%20the%20company's%20technology%20could%20pose%20an%20existential%20threat%2C%20he%20said%2C%20that%20creates%20major%20liability%20and%20disclosure%20problems%20as%20Anthropic%20prepares%20for%20a%20possible%20IPO.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThey%20do%20have%20to%20choose%2C%26quot%3B%20Palihapitiya%20said%20on%20the%20%26quot%3BAll-In%26quot%3B%20podcast.%20He%20said%20Anthropic%20must%20either%20distance%20itself%20from%20Coxon's%20warnings%20or%20accept%20their%20implications.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20was%20also%20skeptical%20of%20the%20extinction%20scenarios%20themselves%2C%20saying%20the%20chain%20of%20events%20required%20for%20AI%20to%20wipe%20out%20humanity%20still%20seemed%20highly%20implausible.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EGary%20Marcus%2C%20AI%20researcher%20and%20author%3Cp%3EGary%20Marcus%2C%20the%20famed%20AI%20contrarian%2C%20said%20AI%20as%20it%20exists%20now%20poses%20little%20threat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20am%20tired%20of%20the%20cosplay%20and%20am%20going%20to%20blunt%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote%20on%20X%20on%20Sunday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20main%20kind%20of%20AI%20we%20need%20to%20worry%20about%20is%20general%20purpose%20AI%20agents%20that%20are%20hooked%20up%20to%20the%20internet.%20Most%20of%20them%20are%20unreliable%2C%20unable%20to%20systematically%20follow%20instructions.%20Coupled%20with%20internet%20access%20they%20can%20hack%20credentials%20and%20websites%3B%20given%20time%20they%20can%20probably%20do%20a%20lot%20worse%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20added%20that%20the%20problem%20isn't%20that%20AI%20agents%20are%20too%20smart%2C%20it's%20that%20they%20are%20too%20dumb%2C%20which%20he%20said%20is%20obvious%20by%20the%20way%20they%20can't%20follow%20instructions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20don't%20(yet)%20need%20slowdowns.%20%3Cem%3EAnd%20we%20certainly%20don't%20need%20to%20panic%3C%2Fem%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BWe%20just%20need%20to%20take%20an%20unsafe%20product%20off%20the%20market.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAlexandr%20Wang%2C%20Meta's%20chief%20AI%20officer%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Alexandr%20Wang%2C%20chief%20AI%20officer%20of%20Meta%2C%20during%20the%20Bloomberg%20Tech%20conference%20in%20San%20Francisco.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f7fdd548c9c486b30e733%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222666%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlexandr%20Wang%2C%20Meta's%20chief%20AI%20officer%2C%20said%20on%20X%20that%20alignment%20could%20become%20the%20main%20constraint%20on%20how%20quickly%20companies%20can%20scale%20increasingly%20powerful%20AI%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAlignment%20is%20fundamental%20to%20delivering%20personal%20superintelligence%20for%20everyone%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20using%20the%20techie%20term%20for%20AI%20following%20human%20instructions%20and%20not%20going%20rogue.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ESatya%20Nadella%2C%20chairman%20and%20CEO%20of%20Microsoft%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Satya%20Nadella%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa7144aec15fe2d3cf16d04%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ESatya%20Nadella%20said%20tktk%3Cp%3EBenjamin%20Fanjoy%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESatya%20Nadella%2C%20Microsoft's%20CEO%20and%20chairman%2C%20said%20he%20welcomes%20Amodei's%20concept%20of%20embedded%20evaluators%20and%20%26quot%3Bthe%20broader%20efforts%20to%20develop%20the%20mechanisms%20to%20make%20this%20more%20than%20just%20talk.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20key%20is%20that%20this%20cannot%20be%20controlled%20by%20a%20handful%20of%20entities%2C%20but%20must%20have%20broad%20representation%20across%20the%20ecosystem%2C%20countries%2C%20and%20fields%2C%20including%20academia%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENadella%20said%20that%20Microsoft%20will%20soon%20publish%20a%20%26quot%3Bcode%20of%20conduct%26quot%3B%20for%20M