0responsibilities%20and%20challenges%20ahead%2C%20but%20it%20doesn't%20help%20to%20scare%20everyone.%20We%20are%20on%20top%20of%20it.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20unlikely%20enough%20to%20calm%20the%20nerves%20of%20a%20human%20population%20that's%20been%20repeatedly%20told%20that%20AI%20could%20take%20control%20and%20do%20all%20manner%20of%20untoward%20things%2C%20including%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-ceo-warning-ai-could-eliminate-jobs-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etaking%20everyone's%20jobs%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20engineer%20Jacob%20Coxon%3C%2Fa%3E%20quit%20the%20company%20this%20week%20and%20issued%20dire%20warnings%20that%20frontier%20AI%20companies%20like%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%20are%20%26quot%3Bgambling%20with%20our%20lives%2C%26quot%3B%20numerous%20leaders%20echoed%20his%20concern%20in%20posts%20and%20essays.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Saturday%2C%20Anthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%20said%20in%20a%20blog%20post%20that%20AI%20swarms%20could%20soon%20take%20over%20the%20entire%20internet.%20He%20called%20for%20more%20stringent%20safety%20regulations%20and%20a%20global%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei-slow-ai-safety-essay-openai-hugging-face-hack-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecoordinated%20slowdown%20on%20AI%3C%2Fa%3E%20development.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpaceX%20CEO%20Elon%20Musk%2C%20OpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%2C%20Google%20DeepMind%20founder%20Demis%20Hassabis%2C%20and%20Hugging%20Face%20CEO%20Cl%C3%A9ment%20Delangue%20all%20said%20they%20agreed%20with%20Amodei.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELonsdale%3F%20Not%20so%20much.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELonsdale%20is%20a%20famously%20conservative%20contrarian.%20He%20founded%20the%20University%20of%20Austin%20in%202021%20alongside%20now-CBS%20News%20editor%20Bari%20Weiss%2C%20which%20counts%20%26quot%3Bthe%20unhindered%20pursuit%20of%20truth%20without%20cancel%20culture%26quot%3B%20as%20one%20of%20its%20core%20principles.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20not%20as%20much%20about%20the%20politics%20as%20it%20was%20about%20being%20contrarian.%20I've%20always%20relished%20standing%20out%20from%20the%20crowd%2C%20standing%20up%20and%20disagreeing%20with%20everyone%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20once%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjoe-lonsdale-perfect-symbol-of-silicon-valley-2017-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etold%20Business%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20a%202017%20interview.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20he%20helped%20found%20and%20later%20left%2C%20Palantir%2C%20builds%20AI%20software%20that%20helps%20governments%20and%20corporations%20analyze%20large%20amounts%20of%20data.%20The%20company%20has%20several%20lucrative%20contracts%20with%20the%20US%20government.%20It%20credited%2093%25%20year-over-year%20revenue%20growth%20in%20Q2%20to%20companies%20purchasing%20its%20enterprise%20software.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20weekend%20take%20that%20everything's%20going%20to%20be%20just%20fine%2C%20Lonsdale%20appears%20aligned%20with%20President%20Donald%20Trump.%20The%20president%20has%20repeatedly%20scoffed%20at%20AI%20doomerism%2C%20emphasizing%20the%20need%20to%20stay%20ahead%20of%20China%20in%20the%20AI%20race.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20Ireland%20on%20Sunday%2C%20Trump%20said%20AI%20leaders%20who%20have%20issued%20warnings%20about%20the%20tech's%20potential%20for%20misuse%20are%20%26quot%3Bbringing%20up%20things%20that%20won't%20happen.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhoever%20wins%20with%20AI%20wins%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20president%20told%20reporters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpalantir-cofounder-joe-lonsdale-ai-threat-risks-safety-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789319440000%2