ider.com%2Fmarketing-pro-quit-job-travel-and-rethink-her-career-2025-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehead%20of%20marketing%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20an%20entertainment%20group.%20I%20left%20that%20job%20due%20to%20burnout.%20I%20pivoted%20to%20becoming%20a%20professional%20organizer%20and%20started%20a%20successful%20Instagram%20account%20and%20business.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20I%20got%20divorced%20five%20years%20ago%20and%20had%20to%20return%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmidlife-gap-year-career-break-corporate-america-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecorporate%20world%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20went%20back%20to%20what%20I%20knew%2C%20working%20as%20a%20marketing%20consultant.%20My%20contract%20ended%20eight%20months%20ago.%20I%20expected%20it%2C%20but%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjob-search-networking-resume-early-career-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ejob%20search%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20find%20a%20new%20marketing%20client%20has%20been%20tough.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222e2f2d55-377d-4da3-84eb-06c572abf60a%5C%22%3EI've%20only%20had%202%20interviews%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20eight%20months%2C%20I've%20only%20had%20two%20interviews.%20I've%20been%20carrying%20my%20whole%20household%20as%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fempty-nester-single-parent-lonely-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esingle%20parent%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20sole%20provider%20for%20two%20kids%2C%20ages%209%20and%2012.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%20very%20far%20in%20an%20interview%20process%20a%20few%20weeks%20ago%20for%20a%20head%20of%20brand%20and%20communications%20position.%20It%20felt%20like%20my%20last%20lifeline.%20I%20told%20myself%2C%20%26quot%3BOK%2C%20when%20I%20get%20this%20job%2C%20I'll%20be%20able%20to%20keep%20my%20lifestyle%20as%20it%20is%3B%20I%20won't%20have%20to%20sell%20my%20house.%26quot%3B%20I%20was%20picking%20my%20kids%20up%20at%20school%20when%20I%20got%20the%20call%20that%20they%20loved%20me%2C%20but%20someone%20else%20got%20the%20job.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221206%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Woman%20posing%20for%20photo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2e113cc23a829a3b8fed6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22707%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ECamila%20Valim's%20reel%20about%20working%20delivering%20food%20after%20a%20corporate%20career%20went%20viral.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Camila%20Valim%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20knew%20then%20I%20had%20to%20make%20really%20serious%20decisions%20and%20take%20steps%20that%20weren't%20going%20to%20be%20fun.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d0129907-8f17-43fa-b222-e8b777b7bae2%5C%22%3EMy%20food%20delivery%20job%20is%20flexible%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EA%20cousin%20suggested%20I%20do%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fkitchen%2Fbest-meal-kit-delivery-service%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emeal%20deliveries%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20my%20e-bike%20while%20I%20searched%20for%20a%20new%20corporate%20job.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20process%20was%20very%20quick%2C%20and%20I%20got%20approved%20to%20deliver%20in%20no%20time.%20It's%20flexible%20and%20fits%20with%20my%20single-parent%20schedule.%20I%20can%20be%20there%20for%20my%20kids%2C%20still%20look%20for%20a%20job%20in%20corporate%2C%20and%20create%20content%20and%20rebuild%20my%20organizing%20business%20at%20once.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20learned%20a%20lot%20on%20the%20bike%2C%20such%20as%20punctuality%20in%20a%20way%20I've%20never%20had%20to%20deal%20with%20before.%20I'm%20bringing%20food%20and%20smiles%20to%20people%20at%20their%20doors%2C%20and%20I%20love%20the%20freedom%20of%20being%20on%20the%20bike.%20It's%20a%20rush%2C%20and%20it%20gives%20me%20time%20to%20think.%20I%20have%20lots%20of%20insights%20and%20ideas%20on%20the%20bike.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20freedom%20has%20helped%20me%20create%20healthy%20space%20in%20my%20mind%20and%20take%20my%20creativity%20places%20it%20hasn't%20been%20before.%20For%20example%2C%20while%20on%20the%20bike%2C%20I%20had%20the%20idea%20to%20print%20out%20my%20story%20and%20CV%20and%20hand%20them%20out%20to%20people.%20I%20deliver%20to%20a%20lot%20of%20people%20who%20work%20for%20big%20businesses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20will%20take%20income%20in%20any%20form%20I%20can%20get%20and%20do%20whatever%20it%20takes.%20I'm%20working%20on%20growing%20my%20Instagram%20account%20again.%20I%20know%20I%20have%20to%20sell%20my%20house%2C%20but%20I'm%20grateful%20I%20have%20it%20as%20a%20backup%20plan%20to%20put%20more%20money%20on%20the%20table%20to%20put%20food%20on%20the%20table.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f887ce05-18c0-4ec6-9ea8-748e034c86d7%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20think%20people%20recognize%20themselves%20in%20me%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20is%20a%20bridge%20for%20me%20until%20my%20house%20sells.%20I%20cannot%20live%20off%20of%20delivering%20food%2C%20and%20I%20am%20still%20pursuing%20the%20next%20chapter%20of%20my%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20posted%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fjoy.in.organizing%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EInstagram%20reel%3C%2Fa%3E%20about%20how%20this%20is%20not%20how%20I%20saw%20life%20at%2045.%20It%20went%20viral.%20It%20has%20almost%20900%2C000%20views.%20I%20think%20it%20went%20viral%20because%20I%20was%20refusing%20to%20feel%20ashamed%2C%20and%20I%20hopefully%20gave%20other%20people%20permission%20to%20stop%20feeling%20ashamed%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20expected%20it%20to%20resonate%20with%20women%2C%20but%20it%20resonated%20with%20men%20as%20well.%20I%20have%20women%20and%20men%20messaging%20me%2C%20saying%20they've%20never%20told%20anyone%20they're%20in%20the%20same%20position.%20I%20think%20that%20tells%20you%20how%20much%20silence%20there%20is%20around%20this%20for%20everyone.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2F