%20to%20a%20person%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter.%20Nasdaq%20secured%20the%20coveted%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-ipo-live-updates-pricing-spcx-stock-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESpaceX%20listing%20earlier%20this%20year.%3C%2Fa%3E%20SpaceX%20was%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-shares-volatility-early-investors-cash-out-analyst-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Evalued%20at%20%241.75%20trillion%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20some%20estimates%20have%20put%20Anthropic%20at%20%242%20trillion%2C%20though%20that%20figure%20has%20not%20yet%20been%20finalized.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20record-setting%20size%20of%20these%20IPOs%2C%20combined%20with%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fmarkets.businessinsider.com%2Fnews%2Fstocks%2Ftech-ipo-market-is-shaping-up-to-be-another-dud-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edearth%20in%20tech%20listings%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20recent%20years%2C%20has%20made%20winning%20this%20competition%20particularly%20valuable.%20Both%20hope%20to%20be%20seen%20as%20the%20home%20for%20future%20AI%20IPOs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20is%20preparing%20to%20IPO%20at%20a%20time%20when%20OpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-ipo-sam-altman-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esays%20that%20it%20wouldn't%20go%20public%3C%2Fa%3E%20right%20now%20amid%20the%20controversy%20surrounding%20existential%20threats%20from%20AI.%20That%20risk%20gained%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei-slow-ai-safety-essay-openai-hugging-face-hack-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emore%20attention%3C%2Fa%3E%20last%20week%20after%20a%20viral%20tweet%20from%20a%20f%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eormer%20Anthropic%20employee%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20warning%20of%20a%20greater%20than%2010%25%20human%20extinction%20risk.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHistorically%2C%20the%20New%20York%20Stock%20Exchange%20has%20won%20many%20of%20the%20largest%20listings%2C%20but%20Nasdaq%20has%20remained%20strong%20in%20tech%2C%20with%20large%20listings%20including%20Cerebras%20and%20Rivian.%20Listings%20on%20its%20exchange%20a%20prerequisite%20for%20inclusion%20in%20the%20Nasdaq%20100%20Index.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20terms%20of%20how%20Anthropic%20ultimately%20trades%2C%20this%20decision%20likely%20matters%20little.%20There%20isn't%20a%20definitive%20answer%20on%20whether%20companies%20perform%20better%20on%20one%20exchange%20versus%20another.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20key%20difference%20between%20the%20exchanges%20concerns%20market-maker%20mechanics.%20They%20have%20different%20processes%20for%20determining%20the%20opening%20price%20on%20the%20first%20day%20of%20trading%2C%20and%20high-volume%20IPOs%20can%20cause%20delays%20and%20confusion.%20Nasdaq%20experienced%20technical%20issues%20on%20the%20first%20day%20of%20Facebook's%202012%20IPO.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic's%20IPO%20filing%20has%20not%20yet%20been%20made%20public%2C%20but%20the%20company%20will%20need%20to%20release%20its%20financials%20at%20least%2015%20days%20before%20it%20begins%20its%20investor%20road%20show.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20Katie%20Roof%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Akroof%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Ekroof%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20Signal%20at%20%40kroof.26%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-selects-nasdaq-for-ipo-amid-ai-risk-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789315298000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a326d3e2bbd1d834ef24770%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-selects-nasdaq-for-ipo-amid-ai-risk-concerns-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Anthropic%20is%20eyeing%20a%20%242%20trillion%20IPO%20in%20October%20amid%20AI%20safety%20concerns.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22kroof%40businessinsider.com%20(Katie%20Roof)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A94%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20partner%20and%20I%20split%20our%20lives%20between%20the%20US%20and%20Canada%20%E2%80%94%20and%20have%20no%20plans%20to%20pick%20just%20one%20place%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221470%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20and%20her%20partner%20hold%20hands%20and%20pose%20in%20front%20of%20an%20outdoor%20stage%20in%20the%20grass%20in%20Chicago.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99999bb56943d508c4b202%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221092%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20feel%20like%20I%20can%20enjoy%20the%20best%20parts%20of%20the%20US%20and%20Canada.%3Cp%3ECatherine%20Collins%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMy%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpartner-lives-in-different-country-good-for-relationship-parenting-2026-5%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Epartner%20lives%20in%20Canada%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20I'm%20in%20the%20US%20%E2%80%94%20and%20neither%20of%20us%20has%20immediate%20plans%20to%20move.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESpending%20time%20in%20both%20places%20lets%20me%20enjoy%20my%20favorite%20parts%20of%20both%20American%20and%20Canadian%20culture.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIn%20the%20future%2C%20we've%20discussed%20living%20in%20Canada%20for%20half%20the%20year%20and%20spending%20winters%20in%20the%20US.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20a%20week%20every%20month%2C%20I%20take%20a%20two-and-a-half-hour%20flight%20from%20Chicago%20to%20Winnipeg%2C%20Canada.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20might%20sound%20surprising%3A%20It's%20a%20lot%20of%20time%20to%20spend%20in%20the%20air%2C%20and%20Chicago%20has%20so%20much%20to%20offer.%20However%2C%20I've%20been%20in%20a%20long-distance%20relationship%20with%20my%20Canadian%20partner%2C%20Andrew%2C%20for%20over%20two%20years%2C%20and%20neither%20of%20us%20is%20ready%20to%20move%20just%20yet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAndrew%20and%20I%20met%20at%20a%20conference%20for%20financial%20bloggers%20a%20decade%20ago%2C%20and%20we%20were%20great%20friends%20and%20colleagues%20for%20many%20years%20before%20we%20became%20a%20couple.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToday%2C%20we%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-son-built-successful-business-together-fought-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erun%20an%20online%20business%20together%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20allows%20us%20to%20work%20remotely%20and%20travel%20regularly%20between%20our%20countries.%20Because%20we%20both%20have%20children%20from%20previous%20marriages%2C%20neither%20of%20us%20plans%20to%20move%20countries%20anytime%20soon.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22feee47b5-8ccb-49b2-9706-a436cbcc9a38%5C%22%3EThere%20are%20challenges%2C%20but%20I%20feel%20like%20I%20get%20the%20best%20of%20both%20worlds%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22838%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20and%20her%20partner%20sledding%20with%20a%20pack%20of%20dogs%20in%20snowy%20woods%20in%20Canada.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a999bf2b56943d508c4b21b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22670%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIn%20my%20experience%2C%20Canada%20has%20a%20more%20relaxed%20pace.%3Cp%3ECatherine%20Collins%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20an%20American%2C%20I've%20gotten%20used%20to%20certain%20apps%2C%20tools%2C%20and%20conveniences%20that%20I%20can't%20access%20in%20Canada.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20example%2C%20Canada%20doesn't%20have%20Venmo%20or%20Cash%20App%2C%20so%20Andrew%20and%20I%20split%20costs%20or%20pay%20each%20other%20back%20using%20Wise.%20If%20we%20start%20a%20movie%20on%20Hulu%2C%20we%20can%20only%20watch%20it%20when%20we're%20in%20the%20States%2C%20since%20the%20streaming%20service%20isn't%20available%20in%20Canada.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20inconvenient%20as%20that%20can%20be%2C%20I%20often%20feel%20like%20I%20get%20the%20best%20of%20both%20worlds.%20Take%20food%2C%20for%20instance%3A%20Andrew%20looks%20forward%20to%20getting%20Chick-fil-A%20when%20he%20visits%20me%2C%20because%20there%20isn't%20a%20location%20in%20Winnipeg.%20(Although%20the%20chain%20does%20exist%20in%20some%20bigger%20Canadian%20cities%2C%20like%20Toronto.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%2C%20though%20we%20have%20A%26amp%3BW%20here%20in%20the%20US%2C%20it%20doesn't%20have%20poutine%20on%20the%20menu%2C%20which%20is%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcostco-food-court-canada-poutine-review-not-worth-it-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eunofficial%20Canadian%20national%20dish%3C%2Fa%3E.%20So%2C%20I%20always%20make%20sure%20to%20order%20that%20when%20I%20visit%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20found%20that%20the%20pace%20and%20culture%20feel%20very%20different%20in%20both%20places%2C%20too.%20As%20someone%20who's%20been%20self-employed%20for%20almost%2015%20years%2C%20I%20appreciate%20being%20able%20to%20surround%20myself%20with%20other%20motivated%20entrepreneurs%20whenever%20I'm%20here.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20Winnipeg%20and%20other%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-places-live-canada-2016-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECanadian%20cities%3C%2Fa%3E%20I've%20visited%2C%20though%2C%20I've%20been%20able%20to%20slow%20down%20more.%20The%20pace%20feels%20more%20relaxed%2C%20and%20I%20often%20think%20of%20Canada%20as%20my%20safe%20haven.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e18368c3-697f-4b1a-b8c4-a79cb2adcdbc%5C%22%3EIn%20the%20future%2C%20we%20might%20choose%20both%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22852%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20wearing%20a%20red%20Canada%20shirt%20and%20standing%20in%20front%20of%20a%20historical%20site%20in%20Canada.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a999d49be454c9d2c7ed89b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22712%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe've%20talked%20about%20spending%20half%20the%20year%20in%20Canada.%3Cp%3ECatherine%20Collins%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20also%20structural%20differences%20between%20the%20two%20places.%20Canadians%20fund%20their%20universal%20healthcare%20system%20through%20taxes%2C%20whereas%20a%20majority%20of%20Americans%20have%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhealth-insurance-changes-2026-medicare-medicaid-aca-premiums-2025-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eprivate%20insurance%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhat's%20nice%20about%20Canada's%20system%20is%20that%20residents%20don't%20have%20to%20stress%20about%20an%20unexpected%20bill%20or%20an%20expensive%20ER%20visit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20said%2C%20there%20can%20be%20trade-offs%2C%20like%20longer%20wait%20times%20for%20emergency%20care%20and%20surgeries.%20In%20the%20US%2C%20I%20appreciate%20that%20I%20can%20usually%20make%20medical%20appointments%20quickly%2C%20even%20though%20they%20come%20at%20a%20cost.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20parts%20of%20American%20culture%20that%20will%20always%20feel%20hard%20to%20leave%2C%20but%20spending%20so%20much%20time%20in%20Canada%20has%20also%20shown%20me%20that%20stepping%20away%20from%20hustle%20culture%20can%20be%20soothing%20for%20my%20soul.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20parts%20of%20American%20life%20that%20Andrew%20appreciates%2C%20too%20%E2%80%94%20but%20I%20know%20that%20if%20we%20live%20elsewhere%2C%20he'll%20miss%20many%20aspects%20of%20his%20home%2C%20like%20his%20close-knit%20family%20and%20the%20beautiful%2C%20wide-open%20prairies%20in%20Winnipeg.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20not%20sure%20what%20the%20future%20holds%20once%20all%20our%20kids%20go%20to%20college%2C%20but%20we%20will%20likely%20spend%20half%20the%20year%20in%20Canada%20and%20then%20