ider.com%2F6aa420bcec15fe2d3cf16438%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221275%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20CIRQA%20packs%20Garmin's%20impressive%20health%20and%20fitness%20technology%20into%20a%20screen-free%20band.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e7cdf0be-74a6-4a84-b5ba-968a1d66676d%5C%22%3EIt%20boasts%20the%20brand's%20excellent%20health%20and%20fitness%20tracking%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20CIRQA's%20biggest%20advantage%20is%20that%2C%20underneath%20the%20screenless%20design%2C%20it's%20still%20a%20Garmin.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20band%20boasts%20long%20battery%20life%20with%20up%20to%2010%20days%20of%20use.%20It%20continuously%20tracks%20heart%20rate%2C%20stress%2C%20skin%20temperature%2C%20Pulse%20Ox%2C%20steps%2C%20calories%20burned%2C%20and%20Garmin's%20Body%20Battery%20metric.%20If%20you%20wear%20it%20overnight%2C%20you'll%20also%20get%20detailed%20sleep%20tracking%2C%20including%20sleep%20stages%2C%20sleep%20score%2C%20HRV%20(heart%20rate%20variability)%2C%20respiration%2C%20and%20nap%20detection.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20fitness%20side%2C%20it%20can%20track%20more%20than%2080%20activities%20and%20delivers%20many%20of%20Garmin's%20more%20useful%20training%20metrics%2C%20including%20VO2%20max%2C%20training%20readiness%2C%20training%20status%2C%20workout%20benefit%2C%20and%20recovery%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAll%20of%20this%20can%20be%20accessed%20in%20the%20Garmin%20Connect%20app%20on%20your%20phone%2C%20and%20it%20all%20comes%20without%20a%20monthly%20subscription%20%E2%80%94%20a%20major%20plus%20over%20some%20screenless%20band%20competitors%20like%20Whoop%20or%20top%20smart%20rings%20like%20the%20Oura.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222590%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Our%20reviewer%20is%20wearing%20a%20Garmin%20CIRQA%20fitness%20band%20while%20holding%20a%20smartphone%20showing%20fitness%20metrics%20outdoors.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4500bcc23a829a3b9089a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221942%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Garmin%20Connect%20app%20lets%20you%20see%20tons%20of%20fitness%20data%20without%20a%20paid%20membership.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c6bc4a32-22d7-43f4-a54f-6ad218914c90%5C%22%3EThe%20screenless%20design%20minimizes%20interruptions%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you're%20someone%20who%20needs%20to%20put%20your%20head%20down%20and%20work%2C%20a%20screenless%20tracker%20is%20simply%20less%20distracting%20than%20a%20traditional%20fitness%20watch%20that%20flashes%20incoming%20texts%20and%20notifications%20at%20you%20all%20day%20%E2%80%94%20even%20with%20the%20sound%20off.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20same%20goes%20for%20workouts.%20I%20like%20having%20my%20steps%2C%20calorie%20burn%2C%20and%20effort%20recorded%20because%20that%20data%20feeds%20into%20my%20daily%20Body%20Battery%20and%20recovery.%20But%20most%20of%20the%20time%2C%20I%20don't%20need%20to%20know%20exactly%20how%20fast%20I'm%20running%20or%20how%20hard%20I'm%20working%20in%20the%20moment.%20Unless%20I'm%20training%20for%20a%20race%20or%20an%20event%2C%20my%20goal%20is%20usually%20to%20check%20movement%20off%20my%20to-do%20list%20while%20pushing%20as%20hard%20as%20I%20feel%20capable%20of.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20me%2C%20a%20screenless%20tracker%20like%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGarmin%20CIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20means%20fewer%20distractions%20during%20a%20workout%20while%20still%20allowing%20me%20to%20see%20all%20the%20juicy%20data%20it%20captures%20later%20to%20inform%20my%20overall%20health%20and%20recovery.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bf72484d-801c-4419-8dc7-3798b911ba63%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Where%20it%20falls%20short%5C%22%3EWhere%20the%20Garmin%20CIRQA%20falls%20short%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Split%20view%20shows%20a%20close-up%20of%20our%20reviewer%20holding%20up%20a%20Garmin%20CIRQA%20band%2C%20revealing%20the%20large%20sensor%20underneath%2C%20next%20to%20a%20close-up%20of%20the%20sensor%20underneath%20the%20band%20while%20on%20our%20reviewer's%20wrist.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4514aec15fe2d3cf166f0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20CIRQA's%20sensor%2Fbattery%20housing%20is%20bulkier%20than%20we'd%20like.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224760a3e2-e8c5-4c1f-a2aa-7f32f9fabfc5%5C%22%3EIt's%20too%20bulky%20for%20a%20screenless%20tracker%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EI%20have%20two%20big%20issues%20with%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGarmin%20CIRQA%20tracker%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20one%20is%20comfort.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20device's%20sensor%2Fbattery%20housing%2C%20which%20rests%20under%20the%20band%2C%20is%20pretty%20bulky%20%E2%80%94%20it%20sits%20a%20full%20half-inch%20above%20your%20wrist.%20Moreover%2C%20the%20tracker%20feels%20substantial%20on%20your%20wrist.%20It%20weighs%200.75%20ounces%2C%20which%20doesn't%20sound%20like%20a%20lot%20in%20the%20grand%20scheme%20of%20things.%20But%20for%20a%20tracker%20%E2%80%94%20especially%20one%20that%20doesn't%20have%20a%20display%20%E2%80%94%20it's%20heavy%20enough%20that%20I%20could%20feel%20it%20and%20was%20aware%20of%20it%20at%20all%20times.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20after%20two%20weeks%20of%20continuous%20use%2C%20I%20was%20very%20aware%20that%20it%20was%20on%20my%20wrist.%20After%20four%20weeks%20of%20testing%2C%20I%20still%20hadn't%20gotten%20used%20to%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20also%20struggled%20to%20get%20the%20band%20tension%20right.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20uses%20a%20hook-and-loop%20velcro%20system%2C%20but%20because%20the%20sensor%2Fbattery%20housing%20is%20so%20bulky%2C%20when%20I%20adjusted%20it%20to%20what%20felt%20comfortably%20snug%2C%20I%20sometimes%20woke%20up%20with%20indents%20on%20my%20skin.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20my%20opinion%2C%20half%20the%20point%20of%20a%20screenless%20tracker%20is%20to%20forget%20you%20have%20it%20on.%20They're%20supposed%20to%20be%20as%20discreet%20as%20possible%20while%20still%20capturing%20the%20health%20and%20fitness%20data%20users%20want%2C%20but%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20simply%20falls%20short%20in%20its%20physical%20design.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221423%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Close-up%20of%20our%20reviewer's%20outstretched%20arm%20wearing%20a%20Garming%20CIRQA%20smart%20band%20indoors.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa421a19b8974787b1cb0a6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221068%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20band's%20sensor%20left%20occasional%20indents%20on%20our%20skin%20when%20worn%20overnight.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a30a86d9-b3b9-409b-b6e5-00250c9ca6e0%5C%22%3EThe%20start%2Fstop%20button%20is%20cool%20in%20theory%2C%20but%20not%20that%20useful%20in%20practice%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20only%20one%20button%2C%20a%20small%20one%20on%20the%20side%20that%20you%20can%20program%20to%20start%20tracking%20your%20favorite%20or%20most-frequently-used%20activity.%20On%20the%20one%20hand%2C%20this%20is%20a%20smart%20solution%20to%20a%20major%20gripe%20I%20have%20with%20other%20screenless%20trackers%20like%20the%20Whoop%20and%20Fitbit%20Air%3A%20you%20have%20to%20open%20the%20app%20and%20cycle%20through%20a%20few%20buttons%20to%20track%20a%20walk%20or%20a%20bike%20ride.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20set%20my%20button%20to%20walking%20because%20this%20is%20the%20activity%20I'm%20the%20least%20likely%20to%20pull%20out%20my%20phone%20for%20before%20launching%20into%20it.%20With%20a%20click%20of%20the%20button%2C%20the%20band%20buzzes%20to%20show%20that%20tracking%20has%20begun.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20more%20than%20once%2C%20I%20found%20myself%20detangling%20dog%20leashes%2C%20setting%20out%2C%20and%20then%20second-guessing%20whether%20I%20had%20already%20pressed%20the%20button%20or%20just%20intended%20to.%20There's%20no%20light%20or%20other%20visual%20indicator%20to%20confirm%20that%20an%20activity%20is%20currently%20recording%2C%20and%20you%20can't%20check%20on%20your%20wrist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20a%20small%20detail%2C%20but%20it%20kind%20of%20negates%20the%20advantage%20of%20having%20a%20fuss-free%20activity%20start%20button%20in%20the%20first%20place.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%2C%20in%20the%20bigger%20picture%2C%20most%20people%20who%20use%20a%20Garmin%20aren't%20looking%20to%20track%20one%20single%20kind%20of%20activity.%20It'd%20be%20much%20more%20helpful%20if%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGarmin%20CIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20had%20a%20smart-sensing%20system%20like%20Oura's%2C%20so%20you%20could%20press%20the%20button%20to%20start%20recording%20%3Cem%3Eany%20%3C%2Fem%3Eactivity%20and%20then%20check%20the%20app%20later%20to%20confirm%20whether%20you%20were%20on%20a%20walk%2C%20run%2C%20bike%20ride%2C%20ski%20lap%2C%20etc.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c745b93e-7c74-457e-be8f-9bcb5861f849%5C%22%3EThe%20lack%20of%20a%20screen%20creates%20more%20compromises%20than%20benefits%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20I%20like%20the%20appeal%20of%20a%20screen-free%20wearable%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20does%20the%20bare%20minimum%20%E2%80%94%20and%20doesn't%20offer%20a%20real%20reason%20to%20choose%20it%20over%20a%20screenless%20competitor%20other%20than%20the%20fact%20that%20it's%20Garmin.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERemoving%20a%20screen%20works%20best%20when%20the%20hardware%20becomes%20dramatically%20more%20discreet%20in%20return.%20With%20its%20thick%20band%2C%20the%20CIRQA%20is%20still%20very%20noticeable%20on%20your%20wrist.%20And%20with%20its%20high%20profile%20and%20heft%2C%20you're%20always%20aware%20it's%20there.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20I'm%20wearing%20a%20fitness%20band%20that's%20noticeable%20to%20myself%20and%20others%2C%20I'd%20rather%20have%20access%20to%20Garmin's%20excellent%20real-time%20data%20with%20a%20screen.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22394fe066-305f-4044-8fe5-266803077eef%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Alternatives%5C%22%3EGarmin%20CIRQA%20vs.%20Fitbit%20Air%20vs.%20Whoop%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Split-view%20images%20show%20a%20close-up%20of%20a%20Whoop%20fitness%20band%20on%20a%20wrist%20and%20a%20mirror%20selfie%20of%20our%20reviewer%20wearing%20a%20Fibit%20Air%20smart%20band.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa42325ec15fe2d3cf16457%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Whoop%205.0%20(left)%20is%20a%20great%20screenless%20tracker%20for%20workouts%2C%20while%20the%20Fitbit%20Air%20(right)%20is%20ideal%20for%20casual%20users%20who%20want%20a%20discreet%20health%20band.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ECompared%20with%20competing%20screenless%20fitness%20bands%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGarmin%20CIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20simply%20falls%20short%2C%20with%20Fibit%20and%20Whoop%20both%20offering%20better%20value%20depending%20on%20your%20priorities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20less%20expensive%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Ffitbit-air-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFitbit%20Air%3C%2Fa%3E%20makes%20the%20most%20sense%20for%20most%20people%20considering%20a%20screen-free%20tracker.%20It's%20thinner%20and%20lighter%2C%20costs%20%24100%2C%20and%20similarly%20focuses%20on%20passively%20tracking%20everyday%20movement%2C%20sleep%2C%20and%20health%20without%20putting%20another%20screen%20on%20your%20wrist.%20Having%20tested%20both%2C%20I%20also%20found%20the%20Fitbit%20Air%20to%20be%20more%20discreet%2C%20so%20it%20blended%20into%20more%20outfits%20and%20was%20substantially%20easier%20to%20forget%20I%20was%20wearing%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you're%20an%20athlete%20looking%20to%20improve%20your%20fitness%20and%20recovery%20without%20the%20distractions%20of%20a%20watch%20face%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D78dcff9250bce1edb19a6f53e15b87e296790a18a548d199eeddc08bf00c5ea7%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FWHOOP-Life-12-Month-Membership-Pressure%252Fdp%252FB0DY2SWV16%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWhoop%205.0%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20a%20better%20choice.%20It's%20designed%20for%20people%20who%20train%20hard%20%E2%80%94%20runners%2C%20triathletes%2C%20CrossFitters%20%E2%80%94%20and%20who%20want%20to%20understand%20how%20training%20strain%2C%20sleep%2C%20and%20recovery%20all%20interact%20so%20they%20know%20when%20to%20push%20harder%20or%20back%20off.%20Its%20downside%20is%20that%20it%20requires%20an%20ongoing%20paid%20subscription.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20theory%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20sits%20somewhere%20between%20these%20two%2C%20offering%20more%20advanced%20training%20metrics%20than%20the%20Fitbit%20Air%20without%20requiring%20Whoop's%20paid%20membership.%20But%20the%20vast%20majority%20of%20people%20who%20are%20drawn%20to%20Garmin's%20training%20focus%20will%20be%20much%20happier%20with%20one%20of%20their%20top-performing%20fitness%20watches%20that%20give%20you%20real-time%20workout%20data%2C%20like%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fgarmin-forerunner-265-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EForerunner%20265%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fgarmin-vivoactive-6-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EVivoactive%206%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222d055bba-ed0a-4216-b34b-f8e3ddb7df20%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Should%20you%20buy%20it%3F%5C%22%3EShould%20you%20buy%20the%20Garmin%20CIRQA%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221586%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Our%20reviewer's%20hand%20holds%20a%20Garmin%20CIRQA%20smart%20band%20beside%20its%20box%20on%20a%20dark%20textured%20surface.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa423e8ec15fe2d3cf16461%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221189%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20CIRQA%20is%20an%20interesting%20addition%20to%20Garmin's%20lineup%2C%20but%20it's%20just%20too%20bulky%20and%20pricey%20to%20recommend%20over%20other%20screenless%20trackers.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20think%20Garmin%20makes%20some%20of%20the%20most%20impressive%20fitness%20watches%20on%20the%20market%2C%20with%20top-tier%20GPS%2C%20extensive%20activity%20tracking%2C%20long%20battery%20life%2C%20and%20super%20helpful%20training%20features%20like%20the%20Garmin%20Coach%20and%20Body%20Battery%20recovery%20score%20%E2%80%94%20all%20without%20requiring%20a%20subscription.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20I%20don't%20know%20who%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae0f6d577%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fgarmin-cirqa-fitness-tracker-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.garmin.com%252Fen-US%252Fp%252F1989182%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECIRQA%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20for.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20someone%20who%20primarily%20wants%20passive%20health%20and%20wellness%20tracking%2C%20the%20CIRQA%20is%20bulkier%2C%20thicker%2C%20and%20more%20expensive%20than%20its%20screen-free%20competitor%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Ffitbit-air-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFitbit%20Air%3C%2Fa%3E.%20And%2C%20while%20the%20CIRQA%20is%20backed%20by%20the%20same%20great%20software%20as%20other%20Garmin%20watches%2C%20the%20benefits%20of%20that%20technology%20aren't%20as%20useful%20without%20a%20watch%20face%20delivering%20mid-workout%20stats%20to%20help%20you%20train%20harder.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGarmin%20makes%20excellent%20watches%20precisely%20because%20they%20let%20you%20access%20incredibly%20accurate%20fitness%20data%20%3Cem%3Ewhile%3C%2Fem%3E%20you're%20exercising.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f7165683bb96376c36efc9208ef27f7cddf04fab486a1b134aaddb4261a91f0%26postID%3D6aa2f8675f625f7ae