imes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Faustralia-switched-on-a-7-8-million-wastewater-plant-that-can-process-700-megalitres-a-year-its-inventor-says-it-breaks-down-stubborn-pollutants-16-times-more-efficiently%2Farticleshow%2F134205616.cms%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia-indiatimes-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Faustralia-switched-on-a-7-8-million-wastewater-plant-that-can-process-700-megalitres-a-year-its-inventor-says-it-breaks-down-stubborn-pollutants-16-times-more-efficiently%2Famp_articleshow%2F134205616.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Faustralia-switched-on-a-7-8-million-wastewater-plant-that-can-process-700-megalitres-a-year-its-inventor-says-it-breaks-down-stubborn-pollutants-16-times-more-efficiently%2Famp_articleshow%2F134205616.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Turkish%20police%20detain%20dozens%20in%20raids%20on%20gay%20bars%20and%20homes%20of%20LGBTQ%2B%20activists%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789309556000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fichef.bbci.co.uk%2Face%2Fbranded_news%2F1200%2Fcpsprodpb%2F0cf8%2Flive%2Fcecf2da0-af73-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fcpve191wy47o%230%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Human%20rights%20groups%20in%20Turkey%20have%20accused%20the%20government%20of%20using%20a%20family-%20values%20campaign%20to%20target%20the%20LGBTQ%2B%20community.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fcpve191wy47o%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22World's%20highest-paid%20leader%20gets%20raise%20from%20%241.7M%20to%20%242.85M%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789309521000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134206242%2Cimgsize-53566.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Flife-style%2Fpeople%2Fthe-worlds-highest-paid-leader-just-got-a-raise-from-1-7-million-to-2-85-million-heres-why-his-pay-is-so-high%2Farticleshow%2F134206090.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22In%20a%20bold%20move%2C%20Singapore's%20administration%20has%20decided%20to%20raise%20ministerial%20salaries%2C%20with%20Prime%20Minister%20Lawrence%20Wong's%20compensation%20set%20to%20jump%20by%20nearly%20sixty-four%20percent.%20This%20marks%20the%20first%20adjustment%20in%20fifteen%20years%2C%20driven%20by%20the%20intent%20to%20draw%20in%20top%20talent%20and%20prevent%20corruption.%20Nonetheless%2C%20reactions%20among%20the%20public%20are%20mixed%20as%20they%20face%20ongoing%20economic%20pressures%20and%20higher%20living%20costs.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TOI%20LIFESTYLE%20DESK%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20husband%20and%20I%20were%20college%20athletes.%20We're%20not%20pushing%20competitive%20sports%20on%20our%20kids.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20slipt%20image%20showing%20a%20male%20football%20player%20in%20a%20blue%20jersey%20on%20the%20left%20and%20a%20woman%20playing%20soccer%20on%20the%20right.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa41c52cc23a829a3b905a7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20(right)%20and%20her%20husband%20were%20both%20college%20athletes.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Rachel%20Morgan%20Cautero.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20were%20both%20college%20athletes%20who%20love%20sports.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe're%20not%20pushing%20our%20kids%20to%20specialize%20in%20a%20sport%20early%20and%20encourage%20other%20activities.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20want%20to%20avoid%20injuries%20and%20burnout%20while%20allowing%20them%20to%20explore%20their%20own%20interests.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20were%20both%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcategory%2Fcollege-sports%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecollege%20athletes%3C%2Fa%3E.%20When%20we%20had%20two%20boys%2C%20I%20think%20people%20naturally%20assumed%20we'd%20push%20the%20sports%20route%20hard.%20After%20all%2C%20I%20was%20a%20four-year%20starter%20on%20my%20college%20soccer%20team%2C%20while%20my%20husband%20played%20football%20for%20an%20Ivy%20League%20college.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20we've%20actually%20taken%20the%20opposite%20approach%2C%20and%20in%20addition%20to%20the%20expected%20soccer%2C%20baseball%2C%20and%20flag%20football%20dalliances%2C%20many%20of%20my%20kids'%20activities%20are%20non-sports-related.%20Think%20piano%2C%20musical%20theater%2C%20and%20Cub%20Scouts.%20Our%20kids%20are%206%20and%208%2C%20and%20we're%20not%20pushing%20sports%20on%20them%20right%20now.%20Here's%20why.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b7a68635-ef91-45d0-bd64-2fa59aba50c2%5C%22%3EWe%20want%20them%20to%20be%20well-rounded%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EKids%20around%20us%20are%20engaging%20in%20competitive%20sports%20earlier%20and%20earlier.%20Hospital%20for%20Special%20Surgery%2C%20citing%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hss.edu%2Fhealth-library%2Fmove-better%2Fshould-kids-play-competitive-sports%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ENational%20Council%20of%20Youth%20Sports%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20reports%20that%20about%2027%25%20of%20the%2060%20million%20children%20and%20teens%20who%20participate%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkids-youth-sports-costs-no-regrets-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eorganized%20sports%3C%2Fa%3E%20each%20year%20play%20only%20one%20sport.%20These%20kids%20are%20often%20practicing%20year-round%2C%20competing%20on%20travel%20teams%2C%20and%20in%20some%20cases%2C%20playing%20on%20multiple%20teams%20for%20the%20same%20sport.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20parents'%20intentions%20are%20good%20%E2%80%94%20their%20kid%20loves%20a%20sport%2C%20they're%20good%20at%20it%2C%20why%20not%20encourage%20it%3F%20%E2%80%94%20research%20has%20shown%20that%20there's%20not%20always%20a%20clear%20benefit%20to%20early%20sports%20specialization%2C%20or%20ESS.%20Instead%2C%20I've%20read%20that%20it%20could%20be%20detrimental%20to%20kids'%20sports%20success%2C%20as%20it%C2%A0can%20lead%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hss.edu%2Fhealth-library%2Fmove-better%2Fshould-kids-play-competitive-sports%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eoveruse%20injuries%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%C2%A0burnout%2C%20and%20may%20actually%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sportsmed.org%2Fmembership%2Fsports-medicine-update%2Ffall-2024%2Fthe-fallacy-of-falling-behind-the-realities-of-early-sports-specialization%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eimpede%20overall%20motor%20development%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EDo%20you%20have%20a%20hot%20take%20on%20a%20common%20parenting%20belief%3F%20Email%20Jennifer%20Beck%20Goldblatt%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Ajgoldblatt%40insider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ejgoldblatt%40insider.com%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20share%20your%20experience%20with%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229eeba321-b066-40c2-95f6-def01f0c9dba%5C%22%3EFree%20play%20is%20a%20priority%20for%20us%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20the%20rules%20we%20have%20in%20our%20home%20is%20that%20each%20kid%20can%20play%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspent-thousands-on-extracurricular-activities-how-to-save-money-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eone%20sport%20per%20season%3C%2Fa%3E.%20With%20two%20kids%2C%20we%20have%20practice%20at%20most%20twice%20a%20week%20and%20games%20on%20Saturdays.%20That%20leaves%20lots%20of%20time%20for%20free%20play.%20Studies%20have%20shown%20that%20unstructured%20play%20is%20immensely%20important%20to%20kids'%20developing%20brains%2C%20but%20it%20is%20being%20summarily%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fprojectplay.org%2Fstate-of-play-2025%2Fparticipation-trends%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ereplaced%20by%20youth%20sports%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20its%20demands.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20consider%20it%20a%20win%20that%20with%20two%20kids%2C%20I'm%20able%20to%20reserve%20three%20afternoons%20a%20week%20solely%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-hosts-play-club-where-kids-are-free-helicopter-parents-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efree%20play%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Will%20that%20change%20if%20they%20choose%20to%20embrace%20travel%20sports%3F%20Sure.%20But%20for%20now%2C%20they%20make%20up%20elaborate%20games%20with%20their%20neighborhood%20friends%2C%20ride%20their%20bikes%20and%20scooters%2C%20and%20honestly%2C%20make%20the%20biggest%20messes%2C%20both%20inside%20and%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22dde44d63-ae2a-43b9-bf76-e3b91a3791e2%5C%22%3EWe%20want%20to%20avoid%20injuries%20and%20burnout%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20laundry%20list%20of%20soccer-related%20injuries%20is%20long.%20I've%20had%20countless%20sprained%20ankles%2C%20a%20broken%20nose%2C%20a%20badly%20hyperextended%20elbow%2C%20chipped%20teeth%2C%20and%20torn%20ligaments%20in%20both%20my%20knees%2C%20one%20of%20which%20resulted%20in%20surgery.%20My%20husband%20suffered%20two%20concussions%2C%20which%20ended%20his%20collegiate%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22604%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author's%20husband%20signing%20an%20autograph%20for%20a%20fan%20while%20he%20played%20college%20football.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4218d9b8974787b1cb0a4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22391%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20her%20husband%20suffered%20two%20concussions%20while%20playing%20college%20football%2C%20ending%20his%20playing%20career.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Rachel%20Morgan%20Cautero.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EEarly%20sports%20specialization%20(ESS)%20is%20a%20surefire%20way%20to%20increase%20the%20risk%20of%20overuse%20injuries.%20At%20this%20stage%2C%20I'll%20do%20just%20about%20anything%20to%20avoid%20the%20ER%2C%20including%20putting%20off%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchildhood-sports-mom-lifelong-pain-kids-play-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecompetitive%20sports%3C%2Fa%3E.%20With%20two%20boys%2C%20we're%20already%20frequent%20fliers.%20We%20also%20don't%20want%20them%20to%20burn%20out.%20As%20seasoned%20athletes%2C%20we%20know%20what%20it's%20like%20to%20burn%20out%2C%20and%20we%20don't%20want%20the%20same%20for%20our%20kids.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20sitting%20in%20school%20for%207%20hours%20a%20day%2C%20we%20want%20them%20to%20choose%20extracurriculars%20that%20truly%20light%20them%20up%2C%20speak%20to%20their%20passions%2C%20and%20are%2C%20well%2C%20fun.%20That%20means%20that%20sometimes%20it's%20flag%20football%2C%20and%20sometimes%20it's%20ukulele%20lessons.%20Both%20are%20equally%20valuable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223ed24db1-a0cc-4fcf-8ba2-c6e9b44e23a5%5C%22%3EWe're%20taking%20a%20thoughtful%20approach%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20my%20kids%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkids-dont-need-protection-from-failure-need-help-facing-it-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eplay%20baseball%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20with%20a%20few%20caveats.%20Both%20are%20playing%20on%20an%20official%20Little%20League%20team%2C%20which%20means%20fields%20are%20uniform%2C%20playing%20time%20is%20mandated%2C%20and%20there%20are%20limits%20on%20things%20like%20the%20number%20of%20pitches%20allowed%20per%20day.%20We%20don't%20require%20them%20to%20practice%20on%20their%20own%20time%2C%20unless%20they%20want%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20do%20require%20them%20to%20finish%20the%20season%20if%20they%20sign%20up%20to%20play%20on%20a%20team%2C%20but%20we%20don't%20require%20them%20to%20sign%20up%20for%20any%20sport%20again%20if%20they%20truly%20don't%20like%20or%20enjoy%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20sounds%20random%2C%20but%20it%20seems%20I've%20modeled%20my%20philosophy%20after%20the%20Norwegian%20approach%20to%20youth%20sports.%20This%20was%20brought%20to%20my%20attention%20after%20the%20recent%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcategory%2Fwinter-olympics%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWinter%20Olympics%3C%2Fa%3E.%20In%20short%2C%20Norwegians%20prioritize%20joy%20over%20winning%2C%20don't%20keep%20score%20until%20kids%20are%20older%2C%20and%20don't%20allow%20ESS.%20The%20result%20is%20a%20country%20that%20boasts%20a%20record%20of%20447%20Winter%20Olympic%20medals%20(including%20166%20gold)%2C%20an%20impressive%20soccer%20team%20(hello%2C%20Erling%20Haaland%2C%20who%20we%20all%20enjoyed%20during%20the%20World%20Cup)%2C%20and%20many%20other%20elite%20athletes%20%E2%80%94%20all%20without%20pressuring%20children%20to%20excel%20in%20sports%20early.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20don't%20get%20me%20wrong.%20I'm%20not%20anti-sports.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPlaying%20soccer%20for%20most%20of%20my%20life%20gave%20me%20so%20much%20%E2%80%94%20a%20work%20ethic%2C%20lifelong%20friends%2C%20a%20sense%20of%20belonging%2C%20and%20a%20sense%20of%20responsibility%20to%20the%20greater%20good.%20But%20sports%20aren't%20the%20only%20way%20to%20learn%20those%20skills%2C%20and%20I%20won't%20freak%20out%20if%20my%20children%20choose%20not%20to%20pursue%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-college-athletes-are-getting-paid-from-nil-endorsement-deals%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecollege%20sports%3C%2Fa%3E%20route.%20At%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%2C%20all%20I%20want%20is%20for%20them%20to%20be%20happy%2C%20well-rounded%20kids.%20And%20if%20that%20means%20playing%20sports%2C%20great.%20If%20not%2C%20that's%20OK%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fformer-college-athletes-not-pushing-sports-ees-on-kids-2026-9%5C%22%3E