e%20to%20depart%20home%2C%20it%20hit%20me%20pretty%20hard%3B%20but%20it%20was%20clear%20he%20needed%20a%20change%20and%20I%20willingly%20co-signed%20his%20decision.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ee533fe6-ed48-4d13-8148-873bd26967ab%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20did%20the%20same%20thing%20at%20the%20same%20age%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20son%20informed%20me%20of%20his%20impending%20move%20on%20a%20Monday.%20He%20left%20that%20Thursday.%20I%20didn't%20discourage%20him.%20I'd%20done%20the%20same%20thing%20at%20the%20same%20age.%20Like%20him%2C%20I'd%20notified%20my%20mother%20that%20I%20was%20leaving%20home%20just%20four%20days%20before%20I%20actually%20did.%20My%20destination%20was%20Phoenix%2C%20where%20I%20was%20joining%20my%20brother%20who'd%20just%20moved%20west%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-politely-postpone-accepting-a-job-offer-2015-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eaccept%20a%20job%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20desert%20and%20had%20invited%20me%20to%20join%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20packed%20my%20most%20important%20worldly%20possessions%20in%20a%20camp%20trunk%2C%20shipped%20it%20out%20first%20and%20then%20flew%20to%20our%20new%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20packing%20car%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F691b7d62e1a9cbb014de5bb4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22768%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20kids%20all%20moved%20away%20from%20her.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20son%20was%20riding%20across%20the%20country%20in%20a%20van%20with%20three%20other%2019-year-olds.%20He%20packed%20even%20less%20than%20me.%20I%20don't%20remember%20crying%20as%20I%20watched%20them%20depart.%20I%20was%20already%20thinking%20about%20the%20mess%20he'd%20left%20behind%20and%20how%20it%20was%20up%20to%20me%20to%20clean%20it%20up.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fb5f7754-090c-4dfa-8bc4-fd06b478d53c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20braced%20myself%20for%20what%20I%20was%20about%20to%20find%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20house%20was%20small%20and%20with%20so%20many%20children%2C%20we'd%20converted%20almost%20every%20inch%20of%20living%20space%20into%20a%20bedroom.%20My%20son's%20room%20had%20been%20our%20basement%20playroom%2C%20but%20when%20he%20hit%20puberty%2C%20I%20wanted%20him%20to%20have%20privacy%20away%20from%20his%20younger%20siblings%20so%20sent%20him%20downstairs%20to%20his%20own%20personal%20lair.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20brother%2C%20who%20still%20shared%20a%20room%20with%20two%20siblings%2C%20coveted%20the%20space%20and%20didn't%20take%20long%20to%20box%20up%20his%20belongings%20in%20anticipation%20of%20a%20move%20downstairs.%20Before%20he%20could%20haul%20his%20things%20down%2C%20though%2C%20I%20wanted%20to%20clear%20out%20whatever%20might%20have%20been%20left%20behind.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20nervous%20about%20what%20I%20might%20find%20and%20didn't%20want%20any%20of%20the%20other%20kids%20to%20uncover%20something%20illicit%20or%20illegal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Teenage%20posing%20for%20photo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bdddec15fe2d3cf15765%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22384%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20oldest%20son%20taught%20her%20how%20to%20let%20go.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFortunately%2C%20I%20didn't%20find%20any%20contraband%20although%20I%20wondered%20what%20might%20be%20in%20the%20small%20safe%20in%20the%20closet.%20When%20I%20asked%20him%2C%20my%20son%20said%20it%20was%20empty%20and%20since%20he'd%20lost%20the%20key%20and%20we%20couldn't%20open%20it%20I%20decided%20to%20accept%20that%20answer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20were%20a%20few%20books%20and%20some%20out-of-date%20electronics%2C%20but%20most%20of%20what%20he%20left%20behind%20were%20clothes%20he'd%20outgrown.%20I%20wasn't%20surprised%20when%20I%20found%20a%20Playboy%20magazine%20hidden%20under%20a%20pile%20of%20old%20sweaters.%20In%20fact%2C%20it%20made%20me%20laugh%20as%20I%20recalled%20my%20parents%20finding%20an%20issue%20when%20my%20brother%20left%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2223098902-22b6-48f0-a59f-43cf58755578%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EIt's%20what%20he%20took%20with%20him%20that%20surprised%20me%20the%20most%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20clear-out%20didn't%20take%20long.%20If%20he%20could%20be%20unsentimental%20about%20what%20he'd%20left%20behind%2C%20so%20could%20I.%20By%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%2C%20his%20brother%20had%20taken%20over%20the%20space%2C%20made%20it%20his%20own%2C%20and%20settled%20in.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20intrepid%20travelers%20arrived%20safely%20on%20the%20West%20Coast%20five%20days%20later.%20They%20easily%20found%20jobs%20and%20a%20place%20to%20live.%20My%20son's%20first%20job%20in%20the%20Bay%20Area%20was%20on%20an%20assembly%20line%20in%20an%20electronics%20factory.%20It%20was%20an%20enlightening%20experience%20for%20him%20that%20empowered%20his%20next%20decision%20%E2%80%94%20registering%20for%20college%20and%20setting%20forth%20on%20the%20path%20towards%20the%20career%20he%20has%20today.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20folding%20clothes%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bedbec15fe2d3cf15785%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20son%20took%20his%20teddy%20bear%20to%20college.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20he%20moved%20into%20his%20own%20apartment%2C%20I%20went%20out%20to%20help%20him%20set%20it%20up.%20He%20gave%20me%20a%20tour%20of%20the%20space%20and%20proudly%20commented%20on%20how%20he%20wanted%20to%20fix%20it%20up.%20As%20I%20stepped%20into%20his%20bedroom%2C%20I%20saw%20something%20familiar%20propped%20up%20on%20his%20mattress.%20It%20was%20his%20Christmas%20