hor%20went%20on%20her%20first%20cruise%20at%2049.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EThough%20I%20travel%20often%2C%20I%20had%20never%20been%20on%20a%20cruise.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20had%20misconceptions%20about%20this%20popular%20way%20of%20travel.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAll%20that%20changed%20when%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20went%20on%20a%20luxury%20cruise%20for%20my%2049th%20birthday.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20as%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparents-cruise-europe-trip-while-kids-at-camp-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eseasoned%20traveler%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20it%20took%20me%20nearly%20five%20decades%20to%20get%20on%20a%20cruise%20ship%20at%20all.%20I%20had%20never%20been%20particularly%20curious%20about%20cruising%20and%20had%20some%20pretty%20unflattering%20ideas%20about%20what%20it%20involved%3A%20heaping%20buffets%20of%20dubious%20food%2C%20brightly%20colored%20drinks%2C%20crowded%20decks%2C%20and%20a%20style%20of%20travel%20that%20seemed%20much%20too%20packaged%20for%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20this%20summer%2C%20I%20spent%20nine%20nights%20traveling%20through%20Northern%20Europe%20and%20discovered%20that%20much%20of%20what%20I%20thought%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmistake-ruined-day-of-cruise-how-to-avoid-frequent-traveler-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eknew%20about%20cruising%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20wrong.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20went%20on%20a%20cruise%20for%20my%2049th%20birthday.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author%20and%20her%20husband%20on%20board%20the%20cruise%20ship%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dc859b8974787b1ca969%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20realized%20she%20had%20some%20misconceptions%20about%20cruises.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20sailed%20aboard%20Crystal%20Serenity%20from%20Southampton%20to%20Copenhagen%2C%20a%20voyage%20on%20which%20I%20would%20celebrate%20my%2049th%20birthday.%20And%20this%20was%20admittedly%20a%20very%20cushy%20introduction%3A%20I%20stayed%20in%20a%20Sapphire%20Veranda%20Suite%20with%20a%20walk-in%20closet%2C%20veranda%2C%20and%20butler%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20I'm%20certainly%20not%20suggesting%20my%20experience%20represents%20every%20cruise.%20But%20as%20someone%20who%20typically%20takes%20complicated%2C%20high-effort%20trips%2C%20I%20found%20these%20were%20the%20things%20that%20surprised%20me%20most%20about%20my%20first%20one.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20couldn't%20believe%20how%20easy%20everything%20was.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20on%20board%20a%20cruise%20in%20her%20suite%2C%20pointing%20at%20the%20television%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dcc3cc23a829a3b8feb5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPlanning%20a%20cruise%20was%20much%20easier%20than%20the%20author's%20typical%20way%20of%20traveling.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20accustomed%20to%20doing%20a%20lot%20of%20work%20when%20I%20travel.%20I%20tend%20to%20build%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fplanned-family-trip-europe-without-focusing-itinerary-kids-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eambitious%20itineraries%3C%2Fa%3E%20involving%20multiple%20cities%2C%20hotels%2C%20trains%2C%20flights%2C%20restaurant%20reservations%2C%20and%20activities.%20I%20love%20that%20kind%20of%20travel%2C%20but%20there%20are%20a%20lot%20of%20logistics%20involved%20%E2%80%94%20and%20as%20the%20mom%20and%20travel%20planner%20in%20chief%2C%20I'm%20usually%20the%20one%20managing%20them%20all.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECruising%20took%20an%20astonishing%20amount%20of%20that%20effort%20away.%20I%20unpacked%20once%2C%20put%20everything%20in%20the%20closet%2C%20slid%20my%20empty%20suitcase%20under%20the%20bed%2C%20and%20didn't%20deal%20with%20it%20again%20for%20nine%20nights.%20While%20I%20slept%2C%20ate%20dinner%2C%20or%20watched%20a%20show%2C%20my%20hotel%20was%20effortlessly%20transporting%20me%20to%20another%20country.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20rest%20felt%20similarly%20organized.%20An%20on-ship%20newsletter%20featured%20printed%20itineraries%20that%20told%20me%20exactly%20what%20would%20be%20happening%20on%20board%20the%20following%20day.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftips-before-booking-cruise-ship-employee-travel-advice-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EExcursions%20were%20coordinated%3C%2Fa%3E%20around%20the%20ship's%20arrival%20and%20departure.%20Restaurants%2C%20entertainment%2C%20and%20activities%20were%20steps%20from%20my%20room.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20hadn't%20realized%20just%20how%20much%20mental%20and%20physical%20energy%20I%20normally%20spend%20administering%20my%20own%20trips%20until%20I%20didn't%20have%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20food%20was%20incredible.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22chefs%20behind%20platters%20of%20fish%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dcf0ec15fe2d3cf15d18%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThey%20were%20pleasantly%20surprised%20by%20the%20food%20on%20the%20cruise.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-cruise-food-favorite-dishes-restaurants-ships-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECruise%20food%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20in%20my%20imagination%2C%20was%20mostly%20about%20quantity%3A%20enormous%20buffets%20of%20mediocre%20food%20feeding%20thousands%20of%20people%20at%20once.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhat%20I%20encountered%20on%20Crystal%20was%20very%20different.%20The%20main%20dining%20room%20didn't%20repeat%20dishes%2C%20so%20you%20could%20always%20count%20on%20something%20new%20to%20try.%20Beyond%20that%2C%20my%20favorite%20meals%20came%20from%20places%20that%20I'd%20consider%20hot%20restaurants%20even%20in%20my%20buzzy%20hometown%20of%20Los%20Angeles.%20Umi%20Uma%2C%20created%20by%20Nobu%20Matsuhisa%2C%20served%20sophisticated%20Japanese%20food%20and%20sushi.%20Osteria%20d'Ovidio%20offered%20seriously%20high-end%20Italian%20cooking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EObviously%2C%20this%20was%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-ultra-luxury-cruise-like-seabourn-ovation-photos-review-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eluxury%20ship%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20I%20wouldn't%20assume%20every%20cruise%20serves%20food%20like%20this%20one%20did.%20But%20it%20thoroughly%20dismantled%20my%20assumption%20that%20cruise%20dining%20necessarily%20meant%20choosing%20among%20endless%20ho-hum%20chafing%20dishes%20at%20a%20buffet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20couldn't%20believe%20I%20sometimes%20preferred%20staying%20on%20board%20to%20sightseeing.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20on%20the%20cruise%20trip%20in%20a%20grand%20lobby%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dd1ccc23a829a3b8febd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20was%20surprised%20that%20sometimes%2C%20she%20wanted%20to%20stay%20on%20board%20instead%20of%20going%20on%20excursions.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20this%20trip%2C%20I%20couldn't%20understand%20why%20anyone%20would%20travel%20somewhere%20only%20to%20spend%20the%20day%20on%20a%20ship.%20But%20the%20ship%20turned%20me%20into%20such%20a%20person.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20were%20history%20lectures%2C%20art%20classes%2C%20live%20performances%2C%20a%20spa%2C%20pools%2C%20a%20movie%20theater%2C%20and%20a%20casino.%20I%20entered%20a%20%24100%20blackjack%20tournament%20on%20a%20whim%20and%20somehow%20came%20in%20third%20(I'll%20be%20getting%20mileage%20out%20of%20this%20proud%20moment%20for%20years%20to%20come).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20ultimate%20test%20came%20when%20we%20docked%20in%20Rotterdam.%20We%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fenjoyed-first-organized-tour-country-wouldnt-do-again-pros-cons-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebooked%20an%20excursion%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20Amsterdam%20that%20would%20take%20most%20of%20the%20day%2C%20but%20we%20decided%20to%20cancel%20it%20to%20spend%20more%20time%20on%20board.%20I%20never%20would%20have%20seen%20that%20coming.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20actually%20relaxed%20%E2%80%94%20something%20I'm%20not%20very%20good%20at%20doing%20on%20trips.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20staring%20out%20the%20window%20on%20a%20cruise%20ship%20at%20the%20water.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dd36cc23a829a3b8febf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETraveling%20by%20cruise%20offered%20a%20nice%20change%20of%20pace.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20love%20travel%2C%20but%20my%20tendency%20to%20cram%20a%20lot%20into%20every%20trip%20means%20I%20frequently%20return%20home%20exhausted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20cruise%2C%20I%20slept%20like%20an%20absolute%20baby.%20(My%20husband%20suggested%20it%20might%20be%20the%20gentle%20motion%20of%20the%20sea%20that%20lulled%20me.)%20In%20fact%2C%20I%20slept%20in%20so%20late%20that%20I%20ended%20up%20setting%20my%20alarm%20for%2010%20a.m.%20I%20knew%20I'd%20miss%20regular%20breakfast%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20want%20to%20miss%20the%20late-riser%20breakfast%20from%2010%20to%2011%20%E2%80%94%20or%20sleep%20through%20a%20day%20when%20there%20were%20things%20on%20board%20I%20actually%20wanted%20to%20do.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithout%20transportation%20to%20arrange%2C%20hotels%20to%20change%2C%20or%20a%20packed%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftravel-bucket-list-ideas-destinations-around-the-world-tour-trip-2018-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esightseeing%20agenda%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20manage%2C%20I%20settled%20into%20a%20pace%20I%20rarely%20allow%20myself%20while%20traveling.%20For%20once%2C%20the%20words%20%26quot%3Btravel%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bvacation%26quot%3B%20actually%20felt%20synonymous.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20sometimes%20questioned%20how%20deeply%20I%20was%20experiencing%20the%20destinations.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author%20on%20the%20back%20of%20the%20ship%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2dd5bec15fe2d3cf15d1c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHowever%2C%20sometimes%20she%20felt%20she%20wasn't%20truly%20experiencing%20the%20places%20they%20docked.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Alesandra%20Dubin%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20all%20the%20things%20I%20loved%20about%20cruising%2C%20one%20of%20my%20original%20reservations%20did%20bear%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20usually%20think%20of%20travel%20as%20a%20way%20to%20experience%20a%20place%20and%20its%20culture.%20I%20like%20wandering%20neighborhoods%2C%20eating%20local%20cuisine%2C%20figuring%20out%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmamdani-free-fast-buses-nyc-commuters-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epublic%20transportation%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20having%20the%20kinds%20of%20unplanned%20interactions%20that%20happen%20when%20you're%20actually%20immersed%20in%20a%20destination%20(even%20when%20they're%20stressful).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20port%20stop%20is%20different.%20We%20visited%20some%20incredible%20places%2C%20and%20we%20were%20generally%20there%20for%20only%20a%20few%20hours%20before%20returning%20to%20the%20ship.%20There%20was%20less%20time%20for%20wandering%2C%20spontaneity%2C%20or%20meaningful%20cultural%20exchange.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20that%20sense%2C%20this%20cruise%20felt%20more%20like%20a%20true%20vacation%20than%20the%20kind%20of%20travel%20I%20typically%20do.%20And%2C%20as%20it%20turns%20out%2C%20I%20really%20needed%20and%20enjoyed%20that.%20But%20I%20did%20sometimes%20wonder%20how%20much%20I%20could%20say%20I'd%20truly%20experienced%20a%20destination%20after%20seeing%20it%20within%20the%20relatively%20controlled%20framework%20of%20a%20port%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20if%20my%20primary%20goal%20were%20to%20deeply%20get%20to%20know%20a%20place%2C%20I'd%20still%20choose%20to%20stay%20there%20rather%20than%20visit%20it%20by%20ship.%20But%20I%20loved%20the%20shipboard%20experience%2C%20and%20it%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20one%20of%20the%20best%20trips%20I've%20taken%20in%20recent%20memory.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffirst-luxury-cruise-surprised-me-pros-cons-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789302841000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2db76ec15fe2d3cf15cd1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffirst-luxury-cruise-surprised-me-pros-cons-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I'm%20a%20seasoned%20traveler%2C%20but%20hadn't%20been%20on%20a%20cruise%20until%20this%20summer.%20I%20realized%20I%20had%20misconceptions%20about%20cruising%2C%20but%20was%20right%20about%20one%20thing.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22ehochberg%40businessinsider.com%20(Alesandra%20Dubin)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20started%20a%20real%20estate%20brokerage%20at%2026%20and%20am%20nearing%20%241%20billion%20in%20deals.%20I%20have%20no%20work-life%20balance%20and%20still%20knock%20on%20doors.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221667%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20suited%20person%20sits%20on%20a%20cream%20sofa%20beneath%20a%20large%20colorful%20abstract%20painting%20in%20a%20modern%20interior.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2e90bec15fe2d3cf15d9a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJordan%20Karp%20founded%20his%20own%20brokerage%20in%20his%2020s%20and%20is%20always%20working%20%E2%80%94%20even%20when%20he's%20off%20the%20clock.%3Cp%3EJordan%20Braun%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EJordan%20Karp%20launched%20his%20own%20brokerage%20at%2026%20and%20has%20a%20transaction%20volume%20of%20nearly%20%241%20billion.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EKarp%20goes%20above%20and%20beyond%20for%20clients%20by%20ensuring%20around-the-clock%20availability.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20works%20with%20celebrities%20and%20high-net-worth%20clients%2C%20but%20isn't%20too%20proud%20to%20still%20knock%20on%20doors.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Jordan%20Karp%2C%2030%2C%20founder%20and%20CEO%20of%20Jordan%20Karp%20LLC%2C%20a%20real%20estate%20brokerage%20in%20South%20Florida.%20Karp%20started%20his%20own%20brokerage%20at%2026%20years%20old%20and%20has%20nearly%20reached%20%241%20billion%20in%20transaction%20volume.%20The%20following%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20started%20my%20business%20at%20the%20beginning%20of%202023.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%2C%20I%20was%20working%20on%20investing%20for%20my%20family%20and%20creating%20a%20portfolio%20of%20acquiring%20diverse%20assets%20from%202020%20to%202022.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20cold-calling%20for%20properties%20to%20acquire%2C%20invest%2C%20assemble%2C%20buy%2C%20lease%2C%20and%20manage%20across%20all%20asset%20classes.%20I%20was%20doing%20it%20for%20industrial%2C%20commercial%2C%20retail%2C%20residential%2C%20single-family%2C%20development%20sites%2C%20creative%2C%20and%20opportunistic%20multidimensional%20strategic%20assets%20across%20Florida.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20brokering%20deals%20for%20myself%20on%20the%20side%20where%20I%20saw%20value%20in%20the%20market%2C%20and%20did%20that%20until%20the%20end%20of%202022.%20Then%20I%20started%20my%20business%20full-time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20transaction%20volume%20is%20about%20%24500%20million%20from%20January%20until%20now%2C%20and%20about%20%241%20billion%20lifetime.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20love%20my%20job%20because%20no%20day%20is%20the%20same.%20Here's%20a%20glimpse%20at%20what%20my%20workdays%20look%20like.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229e37ddee-153e-4f20-84c8-815b0919651a%5C%22%3EI%20catch%20up%20with%20clients%20on%20restaurant%20rooftops%2C%20boats%2C%20and%20the%20padel%20court%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20have%20all%20different%20types%20of%20clients.%20I%20have%20celebrity%20clients%20and%20I%20also%20have%20private%20equity%20clients.%20I%20have%20clients%20who've%20sold%20businesses%2C%20CEOs%2C%20people%20in%20private%20businesses%2C%20founders%2C%20chairmen%20of%20businesses%2C%20lawyers%2C%20managers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20my%20clients%20and%20close%20friends%2C%20Austin%20Rosen%2C%20manages%20Post%20Malone%2C%20and%20he%20has%20a%20private%20restaurant%20rooftop%20at%20the%20Electric%20Feel%20Studios%20in%20Miami%2C%20where%20I'll%20usually%20have%20client%20meetings%2C%20dinners%2C%20and%20spend%20a%20lot%20of%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20work%20with%20a%20lot%20of%20music%20artists%2C%20managers%2C%20and%20people%20in%20the%20music%20industry%2C%20and%20we'll%20meet%20at%20Feel.%20I'm%20very%20dynamic%2C%20and%20I'm%20very%20adaptive%20to%20where%20I%20meet%20clients.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20definitely%20important%20to%20meet%20people%20in%20person%2C%20whether%20it%20be%20at%20the%20office%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2