and%20bring%20three%20different%20people%20who%20have%20three%20different%20time%20schedules%20together.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYou're%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20your%20workout.%20But%20what%20you%20do%20doesn't%20really%20matter%20compared%20to%20what%20the%20greater%20goal%20is.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20from%20the%20workout%2C%20I'll%20shower%2C%20and%20it'll%20be%2010%20o'clock%20at%20night%2C%20and%20then%20I'll%20decompress%20from%2011%20p.m.%20to%2012%20a.m.%20and%20be%20on%20my%20phone%20and%20still%20be%20available%20for%20calls%2C%20and%20look%20at%20calls%20that%20I%20missed%20while%20I%20was%20in%20the%20shower.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2278ec5677-5e5d-46f4-b159-df8f67860ced%5C%22%3EI%20have%20no%20shame%20and%20still%20door-knock%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EDoor-knocking%20goes%20exactly%20how%20you%20could%20imagine.%20It's%20uncomfortable%2C%20but%20I%20think%20where%20there's%20discomfort%2C%20there's%20growth.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20come%20with%20value%20and%20you%20come%20with%20service%20and%20you%20come%20with%20persistence%2C%20I%20think%20there's%20a%20level%20of%20appreciation%20and%20acknowledgment%20that%20you%20went%20out%20of%20your%20way%20and%20are%20expensing%20the%20time%20to%20generate%20value%20and%20bring%20something%20to%20the%20table.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPeople%20have%20an%20appreciation%20and%20acknowledgment%20for%20that%2C%20especially%20people%20on%20the%20other%20side%2C%20who%20live%20or%20have%20built%20these%20types%20of%20homes%20and%20have%20this%20type%20of%20net%20worth.%20They%20were%20likely%2C%20at%20some%20point%2C%20at%20this%20stage%20in%20their%20life%2C%20so%20they%20can%20relate%20to%20you%20in%20a%20sense%3B%20there's%20a%20connection%20that%20sometimes%20gets%20built%20in%20that%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221536%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Modern%20waterfront%20mansion%20with%20palm%20trees%2C%20swimming%20pool%2C%20lawn%2C%20and%20private%20docks%20along%20bright%20blue%20water.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2ea71cc23a829a3b8ff54%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20%2451.5%20million%20Miami%20Beach%2C%20Florida%2C%20property%20brokered%20by%20Karp.%3Cp%3E380%20Production%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20want%20to%20door-knock%20on%20as%20many%20homes%20as%20possible%2C%20so%20I'm%20not%20looking%20at%20the%20percentage%20of%20acceptance%2C%20but%20rather%20at%20the%20volume%20of%20business%20that%20I%20get%20from%20playing%20the%20numbers%20game.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20call%20200%20people%20and%20you%20get%2010%20people%20to%20respond%2C%20you're%20busy.%20One%20hundred%20ninety%20people%20are%20rejecting%20you%2C%20but%20the%2010%20people%20will%20keep%20you%20busy.%20And%20if%20you%20call%20500%20people%20and%20you%20get%2020%20people%2C%20you're%20a%20little%20bit%20more%20successful.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20actually%20take%20rejection%20well%2C%20meaning%20I%20can%20handle%20rejection%20and%20I%20can%20continue%20to%20persist%20and%20work%20on%20that%20opportunity.%20I%20know%20there's%20the%20long%20term%20and%20there's%20a%20long%20game%2C%20and%20the%20opportunity%20can%20always%20be%20around%20the%20corner%2C%20and%20you%20just%20have%20to%20keep%20chipping%20away.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20relentless%2C%20I'm%20fearless%2C%20and%20I%20have%20no%20shame%20%E2%80%94%20that's%20my%20business%20model.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELife%20is%20very%20short%2C%20and%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%2C%20people%20want%20to%20see%20results.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmiami-real-estate-broker-jordan-karp-day-in-the-life-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789302241000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2e9309b8974787b1ca9fc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmiami-real-estate-broker-jordan-karp-day-in-the-life-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Jordan%20Karp%20started%20his%20own%20real%20estate%20brokerage%20at%2026.%20Now%2C%20he's%20nearing%20%241%20billion%20in%20deals%20and%20works%20nonstop%20in%20Miami%2C%20Florida.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jpandy%40businessinsider.com%20(Jordan%20Pandy)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20US%20military%20is%20preparing%20for%20mass%20casualties%20in%20a%20major%20war.%20Its%20dentists%20say%20it's%20overlooking%20toothaches.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223146%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20Air%20Force%20dental%20assistant%20uses%20a%20mobile%20battlefield%20dental%20cleaning%20machine%20at%20Peterson%20Space%20Force%20Base%2C%20Colorado.%2C%20on%20Aug.%207%2C%202026.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa463a19b8974787b1cb48b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222097%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAn%20Air%20Force%20dental%20assistant%20uses%20a%20mobile%20battlefield%20dental%20cleaning%20machine%20at%20Peterson%20Space%20Force%20Base%2C%20Colorado.%2C%20on%20Aug.%207%2C%202026.%3Cp%3EGino%20Mattorano%2FEvans%20Army%20Community%20Hospital%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EArmy%20dentists%20say%20war%20games%20omit%20dental%20emergencies%20that%20could%20strain%20wartime%20casualty%20evacuation.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EBroken%20equipment%20and%20limited%20supplies%20can%20hinder%20field%20dental%20training%20opportunities.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EForward%20dental%20teams%20can%20treat%20patients%20quickly%20and%20return%20them%20to%20duty.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EA%20painful%20toothache%20or%20an%20oral%20infection%20might%20not%20sound%20like%20an%20injury%20that%20could%20sideline%20a%20soldier%20in%20combat%2C%20but%20US%20Army%20dental%20leaders%20warn%20that%20in%20a%20future%20conflict%2C%20such%20easily%20overlooked%20conditions%20could%20take%20troops%20out%20of%20the%20fight%2C%20consume%20scarce%20evacuation%20capacity%2C%20and%20further%20stress%20a%20strained%20medical%20system.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20of%20the%20Army's%20major%20exercises%20don't%20include%20dental%20emergencies%20in%20their%20casualty%20scenarios%2C%20dentists%20said%20in%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.armyupress.army.mil%2FPortals%2F7%2Fmilitary-review%2FArchives%2FEnglish%2FSeptember-October-26%2F10-Hidden-Casualty-Load%2FHidden-Casualty-Load-UA.pdf%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erecent%20professional%20article%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20leaving%20commanders%20with%20an%20incomplete%20picture%20of%20the%20medical%20and%20triage%20or%20evacuation%20demands%20they%20could%20face%20in%20large-scale%20combat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDental%20emergencies%20can%20quickly%20render%20troops%20%26quot%3Bnon-mission-capable%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20authors%20wrote%2C%20because%20pain%20can%20make%20it%20difficult%20to%20eat%2C%20think%20clearly%2C%20or%20carry%20out%20important%20tasks%20like%20operating%20weapons.%20They%20described%20this%20as%20a%20significant%20%26quot%3Bhidden%20casualty%20load.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnlike%20combat%20wounds%2C%20most%20dental%20problems%20can%20be%20easily%20fixed%20if%20dental%20teams%20are%20nearby%2C%20but%20despite%20their%20important%20role%20in%20military%20health%20care%2C%20%26quot%3Bdeployable%20dental%20capabilities%20continue%20to%20decline%2C%26quot%3B%20authors%20wrote%2C%20underscoring%20an%20%26quot%3Burgent%20need%20for%20accurate%20dental%20emergency%20modeling%20in%20war-gaming%20to%20emphasize%20the%20importance%20of%20%5Bnon-battle%20related%20injuries%5D%20and%20dental%20emergencies.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPast%20wars%20indicate%20substantial%20demand.%20Dental%20emergencies%20accounted%20for%2019%25%20of%20all%20treatment%20at%20military%20hospitals%20near%20the%20front%20lines%20during%20the%20war%20in%20Iraq.%20Another%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lineofdeparture.army.mil%2FJournals%2FArmy-Sustainment%2FArmy-Sustainment-Archive%2FASPB-Summer-2026%2FOperational-Dentistry%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erecent%20article%3C%2Fa%3E%20by%20Army%20dentists%20said%20that%20dental%20disease%20and%20other%20non-battle%20injuries%20made%20up%20nearly%2016%25%20of%20all%20medical%20evacuations%20among%20troops%20fighting%20the%20Islamic%20State%20in%20Iraq%20and%20Syria.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlmost%20all%20dental%20patients%20treated%20by%20forward%20dental%20teams%20returned%20to%20duty%20after%20one%20or%20two%20visits%2C%20the%20authors%20wrote.%20Without%20dental%20care%20close%20to%20the%20front%2C%20however%2C%20soldiers%20may%20have%20to%20travel%20farther%20to%20receive%20treatment%2C%20potentially%20removing%20them%20from%20duty%20for%20as%20long%20as%20a%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnext-war-may-leave-wounded-troops-waiting-weeks-for-evacuation-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECasualty%20evacuations%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20any%20type%20of%20health%20concern%20or%20injury%2C%20major%20or%20minor%2C%20are%20likely%20to%20pose%20a%20problem%20for%20the%20military%20in%20future%20large-scale%20combat.%20The%20proliferation%20of%20drones%2C%20both%20attack%20and%20surveillance%20systems%2C%20across%20the%20Ukrainian%20battlefield%20have%20made%20quick%20evacuation%20largely%20impossible%2C%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-tools-aim-to-help-troops-treat-wounds-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Estark%20difference%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20the%20US%20experience%20during%20the%20post-9%2F11%20wars.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20recent%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhealth.mil%2FNews%2FDvids-Articles%2F2026%2F08%2F27%2Fnews573186%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emilitary%20news%20release%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20a%20healthcare%20training%20event%2C%20Army%20dentist%20Lt.%20Col.%20Jesse%20Thietten%20said%20dental%20care%20%26quot%3Bis%20a%20low-hanging-fruit%20solution%20for%20medical%20as%20a%20whole.%20Military%20medicine%20needs%20solutions%20to%20account%20for%20the%20anticipated%20systemic%20medical%20overload%20in%20%5Blarge-scale%20conflicts.%5D%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDental%20emergencies%20could%20rank%20among%20the%20top%20five%20most%20common%20reasons%20for%20casualty%20evacuation%20in%20such%20a%20fight%2C%20Thietten%20added.%20For%20troops%20deployed%20abroad%20in%20multinational%20settings%20alongside%20partner%20forces%2C%20dental%20concerns%20are%20%26quot%3Bthe%20number%20one%20reason%26quot%3B%20for%20casualty%20evacuation%2C%20he%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThietten%20helped%20develop%20a%20lightweight%20expeditionary%20dental%20platform%20for%20special%20operations%20teams%20training%20in%20remote%20parts%20of%20Europe%2C%20where%20teams%20asked%20for%20help%20treating%20dental%20emergencies%20without%20easy%20access%20to%20traditionally%20robust%20medical%20facilities.%20The%20goal%20was%20to%20bring%20care%20closer%20to%20troops%20rather%20than%20having%20to%20shuttle%20them%20to%20far-off%20clinics.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESuch%20an%20approach%20reflects%20what%20Thietten%20argues%20the%20broader%20force%20will%20need%20in%20a%20future%20fight%2C%20including%20more%20dental%20work%20before%20troops%20deploy%2C%20along%20with%20smaller%2C%20more%20mobile%20dental%20teams%20that%20can%20operate%20close%20to%20units%20in%20the%20field.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithin%20the%20Air%20Force%2C%20less%20than%201%25%20of%20the%20service's%20dentists%20deploy%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Air%20Force%20Col.%20Anita%20Shade%2C%20chief%20of%20dental%20services%20for%20the%2021st%20Medical%20Group%2C%20in%20the%20same%20news%20release.%20%26quot%3BOur%20dental%20teams%20are%20often%20disconnected%20from%20the%20heart%20of%20the%20readiness%20mission%20that%20we%20work%20to%20support%2C%20day%20in%20and%20day%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20disconnect%20may%20become%20more%20pronounced%20when%20combat%20casualties%20can't%20easily%20be%20moved%20from%20the%20battlefield%20to%20established%20hospitals%20and%20care%20facilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAsymmetric%2Fhybrid%20drone%20warfare%20shows%20us%20that%20we%20now%20need%20to%20plan%20and%20prepare%20for%20prolonged%20patient%20management%20in%20the%20field%20due%20to%20the%20unpredictability%20of%20patient%20transport%2C%26quot%3B%20Shade%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnother%20problem%20for%20some%20military%20dentists%20is%20more%20basic%20%E2%80%94%20broken%20field%20equipment%20and%20a%20lack%20of%20medical%20supplies%2C%20hampering%20training%20opportunities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETwo%20Army%20dentists%20cited%20those%20problems%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lineofdeparture.army.mil%2FJournals%2FArmy-Sustainment%2FArmy-Sustainment-Archive%2FASPB-Summer-2026%2FOperational-Dentistry%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eanother%20article%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20this%20summer%20on%20how%20military%20dentistry%20must%20adapt%20for%20future%20conflict.%20While%20preparing%20for%20a%20unit%20exercise%2C%20they%20found%20that%20their%20field%20equipment%20had%20not%20been%20used%20in%20nearly%20a%20year%20and%20that%20critical%20equipment%20including%20their%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fmwi.westpoint.edu%2Fsingle-point-of-failure-rethinking-medical-sterilization-on-tomorrows-battlefield%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esterilizer%20unit%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20broken%2C%20underscoring%20further%20readiness%20challenges.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmilitary-dentists-warn-toothaches-could-sideline-troops-in-next-war-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789299001000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4638a9b8974787b1cb48a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmilitary-dentists-warn-toothaches-could-sideline-troops-in-next-war-2026-9%22