2C%20so%20long%20as%20they're%20ready%20to%20learn%20and%20wear%20many%20hats%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0and%20take%20on%20their%20own%20financial%20risk.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20Hollywood%2C%20it%20is%20kind%20of%20like%20a%20foregone%20conclusion%20that%20you'll%20have%20to%20give%20up%20all%20control%20to%20be%20able%20to%20do%20anything%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20YouTuber%2C%20whose%20real%20name%20is%20Mark%20Fischbach%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BI'm%20like%2C%20'No%2C%20I%20don't%20think%20that%20should%20be.'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20decade%20ago%2C%20when%20social%20media%20was%20still%20an%20emergent%20format%2C%20many%20influencers%20viewed%20a%20TV%20show%20deal%20or%20a%20movie%20role%20as%20a%20sign%20they'd%20made%20it.%20Content%20creators%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-youtubers-struggle-to-break-into-mainstream-entertainment-2019-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ELiza%20Koshy%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20Bretman%20Rock%20signed%20on%20to%20do%20TV%20shows%2C%20but%20YouTube%20success%20didn't%20always%20translate%20to%20TV%20ratings%2C%20and%20the%20results%20were%20mixed.%20For%20every%20web%20series%20that%20became%20a%20TV%20darling%2C%20like%20Comedy%20Central's%20%26quot%3BBroad%20City%2C%26quot%3B%20there%20was%20a%20project%20that%20stalled%20out%20and%20was%20canceled%2C%20such%20as%20NBC's%20late-night%20show%20from%20YouTuber%20Lilly%20Singh.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYouTube's%20gains%20in%20recent%20years%20have%20flipped%20the%20creator-to-TV%20pipeline.%20YouTube%20has%20become%20the%20top%20destination%20on%20US%20TV%20screens%2C%20reaching%20over%2014%25%20market%20share%20and%20crushing%20competitors%20like%20Netflix%20and%20Disney%2C%20according%20to%20Nielsen.%20Former%20TV%20stars%20like%20Don%20Lemon%2C%20Alton%20Brown%2C%20and%20Tucker%20Carlson%20are%20building%20large%20audiences%20as%20independent%20creators%20on%20YouTube%20and%20other%20platforms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20shift%20in%20audience%20to%20YouTube%20has%20given%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fyoutube-offering-financial-incentives-to-creators-stay-off-netflix-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eits%20top%20creators%3C%2Fa%3E%20more%20power%20relative%20to%20Hollywood%2C%20said%20Fischbach%2C%20who%20has%20nearly%2040%20million%20subscribers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYouTubers%20as%20a%20conglomerate%20are%20this%20powerful%20entity%20that%20hold%20sway%20and%20a%20lot%20of%20eyeballs%20are%20always%20on%20them%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECreators%20have%20power%2C%20but%20distributing%20a%20film%20in%20theaters%20or%20selling%20a%20TV%20show%20is%20a%20different%20skillset%20entirely.%20Fischbach%20thinks%20creators%2C%20who%20are%20used%20to%20mastering%20new%20formats%20and%20come%20from%20a%20DIY%20culture%2C%20can%20learn%20what%20they%20need%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BLearning%20things%20is%20the%20most%20effective%20way%20to%20do%20more%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BI'm%20playing%20catch-up%20all%20the%20time%2C%20but%20the%20more%20I%20think%20about%20it%20ahead%20of%20time%2C%20the%20more%20I%20learn%20beforehand%2C%20the%20better%20it'll%20be.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20doesn't%20mean%20it's%20not%20difficult.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFischbach%20said%20even%20offering%20a%20digital%20version%20of%20%26quot%3BIron%20Lung%26quot%3B%20on%20YouTube%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0his%20native%20platform%20%E2%80%94%20has%20come%20with%20its%20own%20set%20of%20headaches.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEven%20with%20my%20exclusivity%20deal%20with%20YouTube%20for%20distribution%20digitally%2C%20there's%20a%20lot%20that%20I%20had%20to%20learn%20for%20even%20setting%20up%20with%20their%20system%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BIt's%20not%20like%20YouTube%20where%20you%20can%20just%20upload%20a%20video.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESuccessfully%20pushing%20through%20the%20busy%20work%20and%20other%20industry%20red%20tape%20was%20part%20of%20what%20he%20wanted%20to%20prove.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20felt%20like%20it%20was%20symbolically%20important%20to%20carry%20it%20from%20start%20to%20finish%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bshow%20that%20it%20could%20be%20done%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20thinks%20other%20creators%20can%20pull%20off%20the%20same%20feat%20if%20properly%20motivated%2C%20particularly%20as%20industry%20players%20like%20AMC%20Theaters%20offer%20new%20ways%20for%20independent%20stars%20like%20Taylor%20Swift%20to%20release%20movies%20in%20theaters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere%20are%20a%20lot%20of%20creators%20out%20there%20that%20have%20the%20ability%20to%20take%20hold%20of%20a%20project%20and%20steer%20it%20correctly%20with%20their%20own%20vision%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BThey%20have%20to%20expect%20a%20lot%20more%20out%20of%20themselves%2C%20and%20they%20have%20to%20do%20a%20lot%20more%20work%2C%20but%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%2C%20it'll%20be%20their%20vision%2C%20and%20it'll%20be%20something%20unique%20that%20only%20they%20have%20created.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20said%2C%20Hollywood%20is%20littered%20with%20over%20a%20century%20of%20would-be%20movie%20moguls%20who%20thought%20they%20had%20the%20perfect%20idea%2C%20and%20there%20have%20been%20plenty%20of%20creator%20projects%20%E2%80%94%20even%20recently%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0that%20have%20failed%20to%20translate%20a%20massive%20social%20audience%20into%20another%20medium.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20Markiplier%2C%20taking%20on%20the%20challenge%2C%20even%20with%20real%20financial%20risk%2C%20is%20part%20of%20what%20drives%20him%20creatively.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20really%20find%20purpose%20in%20the%20creative%20process%20itself%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20noting%20he's%20not%20trying%20to%20step%20aside%20and%20hand%20over%20his%20business%20to%20an%20outside%20team.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20objective%20is%20not%20to%20become%20an%20empire%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20added.%20%26quot%3BWhen%20I'm%20done%2C%20my%20YouTube%20channel%20will%20be%20done.%20It%20doesn't%20go%20any%20farther%20than%20that%2C%20mostly%20just%20because%20I%20love%20making%20things.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmarkiplier-advice-youtuber-dont-need-hollywood-creator-help-level-up-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789295403000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa450439b8974787b1cb34f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmarkiplier-advice-youtuber-dont-need-hollywood-creator-help-level-up-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22YouTube%20creator%20Mark%20%26quot%3BMarkiplier%26quot%3B%20Fischbach%20thinks%20more%20influencers%20should%20fight%20to%20maintain%20creative%20control%20when%20they%20work%20on%20large%20projects.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22dwhateley%40businessinsider.com%20(Dan%20Whateley)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Grandma's%2072%20and%20still%20working%20to%20support%20her%20children%20%E2%80%94%20and%20theirs%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227597%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Joann%20Ernst%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa30290ec15fe2d3cf15f28%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225065%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJoann%20Ernst%20has%20played%20a%20%26quot%3Bmotherly%26quot%3B%20role%20in%20her%20grandchildren's%20lives.%3Cp%3ERoy%20de%20la%20Cruz%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EJoann%20Ernst%2C%2072%2C%20shook%20her%20head%20as%20her%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgrandmother-adopted-grandson-cant-retire-childcare-cost-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eolder%20grandson%3C%2Fa%3E%20decapitated%20an%20action%20figure.%20The%20other%20laid%20out%20puzzle%20pieces%20in%20a%20line%2C%20surrounded%20by%20a%20sea%20of%20toys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20have%20to%20put%20all%20the%20Play-Doh%20back%20in%20the%20container%20so%20it%20doesn't%20dry%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20Ernst%20called%20out%20to%20the%205-%20and%207-year%20olds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EErnst%20is%20not%20the%20boys'%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcant-retire-grandparents-raising-grandchildren-gas-prices-social-security-costs-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Elegal%20guardian%3C%2Fa%3E.%20She's%20spent%20the%20past%20two%20years%20living%20with%20her%20son%20Jack%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgrandparent-raising-grandchildren-retirement-caregiving-social-security-child-support-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehelping%20with%20her%20grandsons%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20weekends.%20Jack%20had%20struggled%20to%20work%20after%20losing%20an%20arm%20in%20an%20accident%2C%20so%20Ernst%20took%20a%20job%20in%20the%20special%20education%20department%20of%20a%20local%20school%2C%20paid%20his%20rent%2C%20and%20spent%20weekends%20shopping%20for%20the%20boys%20and%20disciplining%20them%20%26quot%3Bas%20a%20mother%20would.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228256%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Joann%20Ernst%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa303539b8974787b1cab7c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225504%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EErnst%20watches%20on%20as%20her%20son%2C%20Jack%2C%20helps%20the%20boys%20with%20their%20technology.%3Cp%3ERoy%20de%20la%20Cruz%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20June%2C%20she%20moved%20back%20to%20Oregon%20from%20Connecticut.%20She%20needed%20to%20help%20her%20daughter%2C%20Joanna%2C%20with%20her%20children%20in%20the%20same%20way%20she's%20been%20helping%20Jack%20and%20his%20boys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20wish%20I%20could%20just%20be%20a%20grandmother%2C%20but%20I%20also%20discipline%2C%20school%20them%2C%20feed%20them%2C%20and%20provide%20a%20home%20for%20them%2C%26quot%3B%20Ernst%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20enjoy%20it%20immensely%2C%20but%20I'm%20unable%20to%20retire%2C%20and%20my%20retirement%20money%20is%20slowly%20being%20spent.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20some%20grandparents%2C%20helping%20adult%20children%20through%20illness%2C%20job%20loss%2C%20addiction%2C%20or%20other%20crises%20means%20taking%20on%20far%20more%20than%20occasional%20babysitting.%20They%20become%20the%20family's%20financial%20and%20practical%20backstop%2C%20spending%20down%20savings%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiming-retirement-older-americans-delay-if-possible-recession-economic-uncertainty-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edelaying%20retirement%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20or%20going%20back%20to%20work%20to%20help%20support%20both%20adult%20children%20and%20grandchildren.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EBusiness%20Insider%20wants%20to%20hear%20from%20grandparents%20%3Cstrong%3Ecaring%20for%20their%20grandchildren%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20and%20older%20Americans%20caring%20for%20younger%20loved%20ones.%20%3Cstrong%3EShare%20your%20story%20by%20filling%20out%20this%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%20nofollow%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fforms%2Fd%2Fe%2F1FAIpQLSc3B3DqRcKUfGoxcUcf_oEPQOwyzJf0I-jL15r4T_XT_ZOs1Q%2Fviewform%3Fusp%3Dpreview%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Equick%20form%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EThis%20year%2C%20Business%20Insider%20has%20spoken%20with%20more%20than%2060%20grandparents%20and%20great-%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgrandparents-raising-grandchildren-adoption-retirement-aging-economy-financial-instability-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Egrandparents%20raising%20young%20children%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20helping%20adult%20children%20get%20back%20on%20their%20feet%2C%20just%20when%20they%20thought%20they'd%20be%20retiring.%20Some%20have%20legal%20custody%20of%20their%20grandchildren.%20Others%2C%20like%20Ernst%2C%20have%20no%20official%20parenting%20roles%20but%20pay%20bills%2C%20provide%20care%2C%20and%20prepare%20them%20for%20a%20good%20life.%20Census%20data%20show%20that%20more%20than%201.1%20million%20US%20grandparents%2060%20and%20older%20were%20at%20least%20part-time%20caregivers%20for%20their%20grandchildren%20as%20of%202024.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227642%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Joann%20Ernst%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa308e9cc23a829a3b90115%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225095%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20boys%20have%20been%20treated%20to%20many%20gifts%20by%20their%20grandmother.%3Cp%3ERoy%20de%20la%20Cruz%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhere%20is%20my%20Barbie%3F%26quot%3B%20her%20older%20grandson%20asks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBarbie%20is%20long%20gone%2C%26quot%3B%20Ernst%20replies%2C%20adding%20that%20she%20threw%20her%20out%20after%20her%20leg%20fell%20off.%20%26quot%3BShe's%20in%20the%20city%20dump.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BCan%20you%20buy%20a%20new%20Barbie%3F%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI'll%20talk%20about%20it%20later%20with%20your%20dad.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Cp%3EErnst%20raised%20three%20children%2C%20mostly%20as%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsingle-mom-living-hamptons-struggling-financially-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esingle%20mother%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Around%202016%2C%20her%20daughter%20Joanna%20developed%20a%20debilitating%20kidney%20condition%20that%20left%20her%20hospitalized%20for%20months.%20Ernst%20helped%20care%20for%20Joanna's%20children%20and%20received%20a%20small%20state%20caregiver%20income.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20never%20ceases%20to%20amaze%20me%20how%2C%20despite%20everything%2C%20my%20mom%20has%20always%20been%20there%20for%20my%20kids%20and%20me%2C%26quot%3B%20Joanna%2C%2043%2C%20says.%20%26quot%