20is%20raising%20her%20grandson%20as%20his%20legal%20guardian%20while%20also%20providing%20long-term%20care%20for%20her%20own%20parents.%20Smith%20has%20a%20job%20as%20a%20full-time%20support%20worker%20for%20older%20adults%20and%20said%20she%20doesn't%20expect%20to%20fully%20retire%20soon.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226759%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Joann%20Ernst%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa303f6ec15fe2d3cf15f40%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224506%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EErnst%20often%20would%20take%20the%20boys%20out%20to%20eat.%3Cp%3ERoy%20de%20la%20Cruz%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20want%20to%20see%20the%20world%20and%20take%20a%20cruise%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20miss%20being%20able%20to%20go%20wherever%20I%20want.%20My%20grandson%20will%20be%2018%20in%20four%20years%2C%20and%20then%20I'll%20be%20able%20to%20think%20more%20about%20myself.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EErnst's%20kitchen%20table%20may%20be%20filled%20with%20receipts%20and%20bills%20%E2%80%94%20groceries%2C%20the%20mortgage%2C%20and%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcar-owners-cant-afford-loans-bad-for-everyone-dealres-2025-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecar%20loan%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20but%20she%20says%20it's%20money%20well-spent.%20She%20tries%20to%20avoid%20thinking%20about%20her%20diminishing%20nest%20egg.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20know%20it'll%20all%20work%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20Joann%20said%2C%20watching%20the%20boys%20dash%20across%20the%20living%20room.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmore-grandparents-raising-grandchildren-delaying-retirement-supporting-children-rent-mortgage-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789295402000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa302c1cc23a829a3b900d0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmore-grandparents-raising-grandchildren-delaying-retirement-supporting-children-rent-mortgage-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Joann%20Ernst%2C%2072%2C%20supports%20her%20family%20financially%2C%20delaying%20retirement%20to%20care%20for%20her%20grandchildren%2C%20amid%20rising%20senior%20caregiving%20trends.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22nsheidlower%40businessinsider.com%20(Noah%20Sheidlower)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%2043-year-old%20with%20colon%20cancer%20used%20AI%20in%203%20ways%20to%20help%20make%20treatment%20a%20little%20easier%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222097%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Smiling%20person%20with%20clear%20glasses%20and%20a%20light%20shirt%20stands%20in%20front%20of%20a%20stone%20wall.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa3e04f9b8974787b1caec3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221573%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERuss%20Read-Barrow%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20colon%20cancer.%3Cp%3ERuss%20Read-Barrow%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ERuss%20Read-Barrow%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20stage%204%20colon%20cancer%20after%20seeing%20blood%20in%20his%20poop.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EUsing%20Claude%2C%20he%20built%20a%20chemotherapy%20symptom%20tracker%20to%20help%20him%20recall%20what%20made%20him%20feel%20better.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ERead-Barrow%20asks%20AI%20to%20create%20a%20summary%20of%20his%20health%20history%20for%20new%20medical%20providers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fman-39-common-colon-cancer-symptom-blood-poop-toilet-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERuss%20Read-Barrow%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20been%20living%20with%20incurable%20stage%20four%20colon%20cancer%20for%20five%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%2043-year-old%20former%20PR%20director%20and%20father%20of%20two%20from%20the%20UK%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20the%20disease%20in%202021.%20After%20seeing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frectal-bleeding-most-common-early-sign-of-colon-cancer-taboo-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eblood%20in%20his%20poop%3C%2Fa%3E%20around%20six%20times%20over%20the%20course%20of%20a%20few%20weeks%2C%20he%20got%20a%20colonoscopy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20multiple%20rounds%20of%20chemotherapy%20and%20surgeries%20to%20remove%20cancerous%20cells%20from%20his%20colon%2C%20liver%2C%20and%20later%20his%20lungs%2C%20Read-Barrow's%20doctors%20have%20stopped%20the%20cancer%20from%20spreading%20further%20since%202022.%20He%20still%20needs%20regular%20chemotherapy%2C%20roughly%20every%20three%20months%2C%20to%20slow%20cell%20division%20and%20prevent%20further%20growth%20in%20his%20lungs%20and%20liver.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20chemo%20I'm%20having%20now%20is%20doing%20a%20good%20job%20of%20keeping%20it%20under%20control%2C%20but%20at%20some%20point%20that'll%20change%20and%20I'll%20have%20to%20have%20something%20else%2C%26quot%3B%20Read-Barrow%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOver%20the%20years%2C%20Read-Barrow%20has%20experimented%20with%20using%20AI%20to%20help%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcolon-cancer-misdiagnosis-young-people-ibs-gluten-allergy-symptoms-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emanage%20the%20symptoms%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20medications%2C%20and%20emotional%20challenges%20that%20have%20become%20part%20of%20his%20life.%20In%202025%2C%20he%20launched%20a%20side%20project%20called%20FcancerwithAI%2C%20a%20blog%20where%20he%20shares%20his%20story%20and%20the%20AI%20cancer%20tools%20he's%20built.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI'm%20not%20saying%20AI%20is%20going%20to%20cure%20cancer.%20I'm%20saying%20it's%20going%20to%20help%20me%20remember%20what%20my%20consultant%20said%2C%20spot%20patterns%20in%20my%20side%20effects%2C%20and%20maybe%20give%20me%20back%20some%20control%20in%20a%20situation%20where%20control%20is%20basically%20an%20illusion%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote%20in%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ffcancerwith.ai%2Fblog%2Ffuck-you-cancer%255C%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eblog%20post%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20hopes%20that%20by%20sharing%20what%20has%20helped%20him%2C%20he%20can%20help%20others%2C%20as%20rates%20of%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fyoung-colon-cancer-rising-new-research-food-gut-health-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecolon%20cancer%20cases%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20those%20under%2050%20have%20risen%20since%20the%20mid-1990s%2C%20making%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eit%20the%20deadliest%20cancer%20in%20this%20age%20group.%20However%2C%20if%20spotted%20early%2C%20the%20survival%20rate%20for%20colon%20cancer%20is%20high%2C%20meaning%2C%20like%20Read-Barrow%2C%20more%20and%20more%20people%20are%20living%20with%20cancer%20as%20a%20chronic%20illness.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20three%20ways%20Read-Barrow%20has%20used%20AI%20to%20manage%20his%20ongoing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Feven-with-insurance-my-breast-cancer-treatment-was-expensive-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecancer%20treatment%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cdf28522-7fb8-4cfb-9b55-a4946258b2c0%5C%22%3EChemotherapy%20symptom%20tracker%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ERuss-Barrow%20will%20need%20chemo%20for%20the%20foreseeable%20future.%20Afterwards%2C%20he%20typically%20experiences%20side%20effects%20like%20fatigue%2C%20nausea%2C%20and%20changes%20to%20his%20mood%20and%20sleep%20habits%2C%20which%20can%20be%20hard%20to%20cope%20with.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20hardest%20part%20day-to-day%20is%20trying%20to%20manage%20the%20energy%20windows%20I%20do%20have%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20started%20recording%20a%2030-second%20voice%20note%20chronicling%20his%20symptoms%20each%20day%20following%20chemo%2C%20and%20wearing%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhoop-ceo-will-ahmed-daily-routine-workouts-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWHOOP%20health%20tracker%3C%2Fa%3E.%20He%20did%20this%20for%20three%20cycles%20of%20chemo%20and%20plugged%20his%20information%20into%20Claude%20to%20spot%20patterns%20in%20how%20he%20felt%20and%20what%20exacerbated%20or%20eased%20symptoms.%20%26quot%3BI%20found%20it%20really%20useful%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20data%20showed%20that%20by%20around%20day%20four%20after%20his%20treatment%2C%20he%20would%20go%20from%20feeling%20relatively%20normal%20to%20exhausted.%20%26quot%3BIf%20you%20see%20that%20over%20time%20happening%20again%20and%20again%2C%20you%20can%20sort%20of%20deal%20with%20it%20better%20because%20you%20know%20it's%20going%20to%20come%20and%20you%20don't%20think%2C%20'Oh%20God%2C%20what's%20happening%3F'%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESubsequently%2C%20he%20started%20asking%20the%20AI%20to%20pick%20out%2010%20things%20he%20should%20remember%20before%20starting%20his%20next%20round%20of%20chemo.%20One%20of%20the%20things%20it%20reminded%20him%20was%20that%20an%20anti-nausea%20medication%20he%20tried%20had%20helped.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20don't%20keep%20a%20record%2C%20you%20won't%20remember.%20You%20think%20you%20will%2C%20but%20give%20it%20three%20months%20and%20life%20will%20take%20over%20and%20you%20won't%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224cdbece6-86cf-4973-bee1-f01c4f2483c3%5C%22%3EA%20medical%20history%20research%20assistant%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ERead-Barrow%20uploaded%20all%20of%20his%20medical%20records%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-spark-proactive-run-background-mcp-gemini-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGemini%20Notebook%3C%2Fa%3E%20(formerly%20Notebook%20LM).%20The%20AI%20is%20designed%20to%20answer%20questions%2C%20spot%20trends%2C%20and%20create%20content%20such%20as%20presentation%20decks%20based%20only%20on%20files%20the%20user%20uploads.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20uses%20it%20as%20a%20%26quot%3Bcentralized%20hub%26quot%3B%20for%20all%20of%20his%20medical%20records%2C%20which%20means%20he%20can%20access%20test%20results%2C%20doctor's%20notes%20or%20any%20other%20medical%20data%20within%20seconds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20saves%20me%20from%20the%20massive%20admin%20headache%20of%20digging%20through%20folders%20every%20time%20I%20see%20a%20specialist%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22004744fd-c824-404b-9a3d-21344b06429d%5C%22%3EGetting%20new%20people%20up%20to%20speed%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20signing%20up%20for%20a%20gym%2C%20getting%20a%20treatment%20such%20as%20a%20massage%2C%20or%20seeing%20any%20kind%20of%20doctor%2C%20they%20typically%20ask%20for%20your%20medical%20history.%20However%2C%20when%20you%20have%20a%20complex%20chronic%20illness%20like%20cancer%2C%20that%20history%20can%20be%20lengthy%20and%20painful%20to%20recount.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20found%20a%20solution%20by%20asking%20Gemini%20Notebook%20to%20summarize%20his%20health%20history%20in%20500%20words%2C%20which%20he%20can%20pass%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERead-Barrow%20is%20aware%20that%20not%20everyone%20would%20feel%20comfortable%20sharing%20so%20much%20personal%20information%20with%20AI%20platforms%2C%20but%20for%20him%2C%20the%20benefits%20outweigh%20the%20risks.%20%26quot%3BI've%20got%20terminal%20cancer.%20What's%20the%20worst%20that%20can%20bloody%20happen%3F%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fman-with-colon-cancer-uses-ai-to-manage-his-symptoms-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789295401000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa3e04f9b8974787b1caec3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fman-with-colon-cancer-uses-ai-to-manage-his-sympt